const DOQUA_SEARCH = [{"n":"Getting started","k":"guide","u":"guides/getting-started.html","s":"Doqua is a .NET 10 class library (doqua.dll, project Sources/Doqua.csproj). An application references it,\ncreates a Window with some controls and hands it to Application.Run."},{"n":"How Doqua works","k":"guide","u":"guides/architecture.html","s":"A short tour of the pieces, so that the rest of the documentation makes sense."},{"n":"Controls","k":"guide","u":"guides/controls.html","s":"The ready-made controls in Doqua.Controls, in the classic desktop style.\nAll of them derive from Control, so they share its position, size, Control.Anchor, Control.Visible, Control.Enabled,\nmouse, keyboard and focus events, Control.Cursor and Control.ContextMenu."},{"n":"Layout","k":"guide","u":"guides/layout.html","s":"A control\u0027s Control.X and Control.Y are relative to its parent; Control.Width and Control.Height are its size\n(or all four at once: Control.Bounds). The window\u0027s Window.Content always fills the window."},{"n":"Mouse, keyboard and focus","k":"guide","u":"guides/input.html","s":"Every control raises Control.MouseDown, Control.MouseUp, Control.MouseClick (press and release on the same control),\nControl.MouseMove, Control.MouseEnter, Control.MouseLeave and Control.MouseWheel.\nCoordinates are relative to the control. MouseEventArgs.ClickCount is 2 for a double click, 3 for a triple click."},{"n":"Custom drawing","k":"guide","u":"guides/drawing.html","s":"A control draws itself in Control.OnRender. Override it in a subclass; (0, 0) is the control\u0027s top-left corner and drawing is\nclipped to its bounds. The framework draws the children afterwards, on top. Call Control.Invalidate when something that affects the\npicture changes."},{"n":"Timers and windows","k":"guide","u":"guides/timers.html","s":"Timer works like JavaScript timers. Callbacks run on the GUI thread from the event loop, so they can change controls directly. Call the timer methods from the GUI thread too; from another thread, post the call (see Threads)."},{"n":"Threads and background work","k":"guide","u":"guides/threads.html","s":"Windows, controls and timers belong to the GUI thread: the thread that creates the first Window and calls\nApplication.Run. Doqua is not thread-safe, so other threads must not change them. Instead they hand the work to the GUI\nthread, which runs it between events. Application.IsGuiThread tells where the code runs."},{"n":"Localization","k":"guide","u":"guides/localization.html","s":"Doqua is in English by default, whatever the system language. Localization translates Doqua\u0027s own texts (menus, the calendar,\nexception messages) and your application\u0027s, and Localization.Culture also sets month and weekday names and date formats."},{"n":"Platform notes","k":"guide","u":"guides/platforms.html","s":""},{"n":"Simple example","k":"example","u":"examples/simple.html","s":"Anchored panels with clickable rectangles, buttons, an input, a live clock and a status line."},{"n":"Tabs example","k":"example","u":"examples/tabs.html","s":"A TabControl with pages for text, shapes, check boxes, radio groups in group boxes and scrolling panels, plus context menus."},{"n":"Dictionary example","k":"example","u":"examples/dictionary.html","s":"A TreeView and a Table in a SplitContainer: each node keeps its own key/value pairs and cell colors; rows can be selected, edited and removed (with a MessageBox asking first)."},{"n":"Editor example","k":"example","u":"examples/editor.html","s":"A multi-line TextArea with scroll bars and a caret position status line."},{"n":"DateTime example","k":"example","u":"examples/datetime.html","s":"Two DateInputs whose ranges limit each other, and a date format selector."},{"n":"Files example","k":"example","u":"examples/files.html","s":"FileInputs with different options: required, file masks, new files, folders and relative paths, with their validation messages."},{"n":"Fonts example","k":"example","u":"examples/fonts.html","s":"All installed font families in a ComboBox, with size and style controls and a live preview."},{"n":"Localization example","k":"example","u":"examples/localization.html","s":"Switching the whole user interface between English and Russian at run time."},{"n":"Threads example","k":"example","u":"examples/threads.html","s":"A background reader posting values to the GUI, an async button that awaits work on the thread pool, Progress\u003CT\u003E, and the error for a control touched from another thread."},{"n":"Bitmap example","k":"example","u":"examples/bitmap.html","s":"Loading, drawing, scaling and saving PNG images, and drawing into a bitmap."},{"n":"Clock example","k":"example","u":"examples/clock.html","s":"A custom control drawing an analog clock with lines and ellipses, redrawn every second."},{"n":"Doqua.Controls","k":"namespace","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.html","s":"Ready-made controls in the classic style: panels, labels, buttons, check and radio buttons, text inputs, lists, tables, trees, tabs, menus, date and number inputs."},{"n":"Doqua.Core","k":"namespace","u":"api/Doqua.Core.html","s":"Information about the library."},{"n":"Doqua.GUI","k":"namespace","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.html","s":"The foundation: windows and the application loop, the control tree, drawing, fonts, bitmaps, input events, the clipboard, timers, cursors and localization."},{"n":"Button","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Button.html","s":"Push button with centered text, drawn in the classic 3D style: a raised edge, a sunken frame while pressed (the text moves 1 px down and right), a black frame and dotted rectangle when focused, and embossed grey text when disabled. Raises Button.Click on a left-button click or Enter/Space."},{"n":"Button.OnClick","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Button.html#OnClick","s":""},{"n":"Button.OnMouseDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Button.html#OnMouseDown","s":""},{"n":"Button.OnMouseUp","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Button.html#OnMouseUp","s":""},{"n":"Button.OnMouseClick","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Button.html#OnMouseClick","s":""},{"n":"Button.OnKeyDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Button.html#OnKeyDown","s":"Enter or Space on a focused button clicks it."},{"n":"Button.OnGotFocus","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Button.html#OnGotFocus","s":""},{"n":"Button.OnLostFocus","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Button.html#OnLostFocus","s":""},{"n":"Button.OnMouseEnter","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Button.html#OnMouseEnter","s":""},{"n":"Button.OnMouseLeave","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Button.html#OnMouseLeave","s":""},{"n":"Button.OnRender","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Button.html#OnRender","s":"Draws this control\u0027s own content. (0, 0) is the control\u0027s top-left corner and drawing is clipped to its bounds. Children are drawn by the framework afterwards, on top."},{"n":"Button.Button","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Button.html#ctor","s":"Creates a 100 x 32 button without text."},{"n":"Button.Text","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Button.html#Text","s":"Caption, centered on the button."},{"n":"Button.Font","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Button.html#Font","s":"Font of the text; Font.Default unless set."},{"n":"Button.Color","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Button.html#Color","s":"Text color."},{"n":"Button.Background","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Button.html#Background","s":"Face color; the hover color is derived from it."},{"n":"Button.HighlightColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Button.html#HighlightColor","s":"Light edge on the top and left."},{"n":"Button.ShadowColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Button.html#ShadowColor","s":"Inner dark edge on the bottom and right (and the inner frame while pressed)."},{"n":"Button.DarkShadowColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Button.html#DarkShadowColor","s":"Outer dark edge on the bottom and right (and the outer frame while pressed)."},{"n":"Button.FocusedBorderColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Button.html#FocusedBorderColor","s":"Outer frame drawn around the button while it has keyboard focus."},{"n":"Button.DisabledColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Button.html#DisabledColor","s":"Text color (embossed with Button.HighlightColor) used when the button is not Control.IsEffectivelyEnabled."},{"n":"Button.DisabledBackground","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Button.html#DisabledBackground","s":"Face color while the button is disabled."},{"n":"Button.IsPressed","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Button.html#IsPressed","s":"True while the left button is held down after being pressed on this button."},{"n":"Button.Click","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Button.html#Click","s":"Raised when the button is clicked with the left mouse button, or with Enter or Space while it has the focus."},{"n":"CheckBox","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.CheckBox.html","s":"Check box with a title, drawn in the classic style: a sunken 13 x 13 box with a check mark. A left click (on the box or the text) or Space while focused toggles CheckBox.Checked."},{"n":"CheckBox.OnCheckedChanged","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.CheckBox.html#OnCheckedChanged","s":""},{"n":"CheckBox.OnActivated","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.CheckBox.html#OnActivated","s":"Called on a left click or Space: toggles a check box, selects a radio button."},{"n":"CheckBox.DrawBox","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.CheckBox.html#DrawBox","s":"Draws the box (edge, inside and mark) into box."},{"n":"CheckBox.CheckBox","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.CheckBox.html#ctor-1","s":"Creates a check box without text."},{"n":"CheckBox.CheckBox","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.CheckBox.html#ctor-2","s":"Creates a check box with the given text."},{"n":"CheckBox.Checked","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.CheckBox.html#Checked","s":"Whether the box is checked; a click or Space toggles it."},{"n":"CheckBox.BoxSize","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.CheckBox.html#BoxSize","s":"Width and height of the box."},{"n":"CheckBox.CheckedChanged","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.CheckBox.html#CheckedChanged","s":"Raised after CheckBox.Checked changes, by the user or from code."},{"n":"ComboBox\u003CT\u003E","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html","s":"Drop-down list in the classic style: a sunken field showing the selected item and an arrow button; clicking opens the list below (or above) it. Items are values of type T, shown with ComboBox\u003CT\u003E. The text cannot be edited. Closed: Up/Down, PageUp/PageDown, Home/End change the selection; F4 or Alt\u002BDown opens the list; typing a letter selects the next item starting with it.Open: the same keys move the highlight, Enter selects, Escape (or a click outside) cancels; the mouse wheel and the scroll bar scroll the list."},{"n":"ComboBox.ShowDropDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#ShowDropDown","s":"Opens the list (if there are items and the control is in a window)."},{"n":"ComboBox.CloseDropDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#CloseDropDown","s":"Closes the list without changing the selection."},{"n":"ComboBox.OnSelectionChanged","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#OnSelectionChanged","s":""},{"n":"ComboBox.OnMouseDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#OnMouseDown","s":""},{"n":"ComboBox.OnKeyDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#OnKeyDown","s":""},{"n":"ComboBox.OnTextInput","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#OnTextInput","s":"Typing a character selects the next item whose text starts with it."},{"n":"ComboBox.OnGotFocus","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#OnGotFocus","s":""},{"n":"ComboBox.OnLostFocus","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#OnLostFocus","s":""},{"n":"ComboBox.OnRender","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#OnRender","s":"Draws this control\u0027s own content. (0, 0) is the control\u0027s top-left corner and drawing is clipped to its bounds. Children are drawn by the framework afterwards, on top."},{"n":"ComboBox.ComboBox","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#ctor","s":"Creates an empty combo box, 160 pixels wide."},{"n":"ComboBox.Items","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#Items","s":"The choices, in list order. The selection follows when items are added or removed."},{"n":"ComboBox.SelectedIndex","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#SelectedIndex","s":"Index of the selected item, or -1 when nothing is selected."},{"n":"ComboBox.HasSelection","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#HasSelection","s":"True when an item is selected."},{"n":"ComboBox.SelectedItem","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#SelectedItem","s":"The selected item; default(T) when nothing is selected (check ComboBox\u003CT\u003E). Setting it selects the first equal item and throws if there is none."},{"n":"ComboBox.ItemText","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#ItemText","s":"How an item is displayed; ToString() unless set."},{"n":"ComboBox.PlaceholderText","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#PlaceholderText","s":"Grey text shown while nothing is selected."},{"n":"ComboBox.MaxDropDownItems","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#MaxDropDownItems","s":"Number of items the open list shows before it needs a scroll bar."},{"n":"ComboBox.IsDroppedDown","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#IsDroppedDown","s":"True while the list is open."},{"n":"ComboBox.Font","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#Font","s":"Font of the field and of the list; Font.Default unless set."},{"n":"ComboBox.Color","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#Color","s":"Text color."},{"n":"ComboBox.DisabledColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#DisabledColor","s":"Text color while disabled."},{"n":"ComboBox.Background","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#Background","s":"Background of the field and of the list."},{"n":"ComboBox.DisabledBackground","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#DisabledBackground","s":"Background of the field while disabled."},{"n":"ComboBox.PlaceholderColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#PlaceholderColor","s":"Color of ComboBox\u003CT\u003E."},{"n":"ComboBox.SelectionBackground","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#SelectionBackground","s":"Background of the highlighted item in the list, and of the selected text while focused."},{"n":"ComboBox.SelectionColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#SelectionColor","s":"Text color of the highlighted item, and of the selected text while focused."},{"n":"ComboBox.SelectionChanged","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBox-1.html#SelectionChanged","s":"Raised after the selection changes, by the user or from code."},{"n":"ComboBoxItemCollection\u003CT\u003E","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ComboBoxItemCollection-1.html","s":"Items of a ComboBox\u003CT\u003E; changes keep the combo box\u0027s selection consistent."},{"n":"DateInput","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html","s":"Date field in the classic style: a read-only field showing DateInput.Value with DateInput.Format, and a button that opens a calendar. The calendar picks a day; its title switches to month and year grids. Dates outside [DateInput.Min, DateInput.Max] cannot be chosen. Closed: Up / Down change the day, PageUp / PageDown the month, the wheel the day; F4, Alt\u002BDown, Space or Enter open the calendar.Open: arrows move by day / week, PageUp / PageDown by month (with Ctrl by year), Home / End to the first / last day of the month, Enter selects, Escape or a click outside cancels."},{"n":"DateInput.ShowCalendar","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#ShowCalendar","s":"Opens the calendar below the field (above it if there is no room)."},{"n":"DateInput.CloseCalendar","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#CloseCalendar","s":"Closes the calendar without changing the value."},{"n":"DateInput.OnValueChanged","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#OnValueChanged","s":""},{"n":"DateInput.OnMouseDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#OnMouseDown","s":""},{"n":"DateInput.OnMouseWheel","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#OnMouseWheel","s":""},{"n":"DateInput.OnKeyDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#OnKeyDown","s":""},{"n":"DateInput.OnGotFocus","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#OnGotFocus","s":""},{"n":"DateInput.OnLostFocus","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#OnLostFocus","s":""},{"n":"DateInput.OnRender","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#OnRender","s":"Draws this control\u0027s own content. (0, 0) is the control\u0027s top-left corner and drawing is clipped to its bounds. Children are drawn by the framework afterwards, on top."},{"n":"DateInput.DateInput","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#ctor","s":"Creates a date input showing today, 140 pixels wide."},{"n":"DateInput.Value","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#Value","s":"The date (its time of day is dropped); setting it clamps it into [Min, Max]."},{"n":"DateInput.Min","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#Min","s":"Earliest date that can be chosen, or null for no limit. Moving it past Max moves Max too."},{"n":"DateInput.Max","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#Max","s":"Latest date that can be chosen, or null for no limit. Moving it before Min moves Min too."},{"n":"DateInput.Format","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#Format","s":".NET date format of the field, e.g. \u0022d\u0022 (short date, the default), \u0022D\u0022, \u0022yyyy-MM-dd\u0022, \u0022dd MMM yyyy\u0022."},{"n":"DateInput.Culture","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#Culture","s":"Culture for the field text, month and weekday names and the first day of the week; Localization.Culture (English by default) unless set."},{"n":"DateInput.Text","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#Text","s":"DateInput.Value as shown in the field."},{"n":"DateInput.IsDroppedDown","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#IsDroppedDown","s":"True while the calendar is open."},{"n":"DateInput.Font","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#Font","s":"Font of the field and of the calendar; Font.Default unless set."},{"n":"DateInput.Color","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#Color","s":"Text color."},{"n":"DateInput.DisabledColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#DisabledColor","s":"Text color while disabled."},{"n":"DateInput.Background","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#Background","s":"Background of the field and of the calendar."},{"n":"DateInput.DisabledBackground","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#DisabledBackground","s":"Background of the field while disabled."},{"n":"DateInput.SelectionBackground","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#SelectionBackground","s":"Background of the selected day, and of the field text while focused."},{"n":"DateInput.SelectionColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#SelectionColor","s":"Text color of the selected day, and of the field text while focused."},{"n":"DateInput.ValueChanged","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.DateInput.html#ValueChanged","s":"Raised after DateInput.Value changes: picked, stepped, or corrected by a new Min / Max."},{"n":"FileFilter","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileFilter.html","s":"A named set of file name patterns for FileInput, e.g. new FileFilter(\u0022Certificates\u0022, \u0022*.pem\u0022, \u0022*.crt\u0022). Patterns use * (any characters) and ? (one character) and are matched against the file name only, ignoring case on every platform."},{"n":"FileFilter.Matches","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileFilter.html#Matches","s":"True if the file name (not the folder part) of path matches one of the patterns."},{"n":"FileFilter.ToString","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileFilter.html#ToString","s":"The name and the patterns, as shown in the file browser: \u0022Certificates (*.pem, *.crt)\u0022."},{"n":"FileFilter.FileFilter","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileFilter.html#ctor","s":"Creates a filter; patterns must contain at least one non-empty pattern."},{"n":"FileFilter.AllFiles","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileFilter.html#AllFiles","s":"A filter matching every file (\u0022All files\u0022, in the current language when it is created)."},{"n":"FileFilter.Name","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileFilter.html#Name","s":"Name shown in the file browser, e.g. \u0022Certificates\u0022."},{"n":"FileFilter.Patterns","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileFilter.html#Patterns","s":"The patterns, e.g. \u0022*.pem\u0022 and \u0022*.crt\u0022."},{"n":"FileInput","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html","s":"A path field with a \u0022...\u0022 button that opens a file browser below the field (above it if there is no room). The path can also be typed. FileInput.Error tells whether it satisfies the options (FileInput.MustExist, FileInput.Required, FileInput.MatchFilter); invalid text is drawn in FileInput.InvalidColor. Field: F4 or Alt\u002BDown open the browser.Browser: click selects, double click (or Enter) opens a folder or chooses a file; Backspace or Alt\u002BUp go to the parent folder; arrows, PageUp / PageDown, Home / End move; a letter jumps to the next name starting with it; Escape or a click outside closes it. Relative paths are resolved against FileInput.BaseDirectory (the current directory if it is null)."},{"n":"FileInput.ShowBrowser","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#ShowBrowser","s":"Opens the file browser at the folder of the current path."},{"n":"FileInput.CloseBrowser","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#CloseBrowser","s":"Closes the file browser without changing the path."},{"n":"FileInput.OnTextChanged","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#OnTextChanged","s":""},{"n":"FileInput.OnFileChosen","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#OnFileChosen","s":""},{"n":"FileInput.OnSizeChanged","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#OnSizeChanged","s":"Re-applies this control\u0027s anchor and rearranges anchored children, then raises Control.SizeChanged."},{"n":"FileInput.OnKeyDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#OnKeyDown","s":"F4 and Alt\u002BDown arrive here from the focused text field."},{"n":"FileInput.OnMouseDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#OnMouseDown","s":"Only the button gets here: the text field covers the rest."},{"n":"FileInput.OnRender","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#OnRender","s":"Draws this control\u0027s own content. (0, 0) is the control\u0027s top-left corner and drawing is clipped to its bounds. Children are drawn by the framework afterwards, on top."},{"n":"FileInput.FileInput","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#ctor","s":"Creates an empty file input, 260 pixels wide."},{"n":"FileInput.Text","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#Text","s":"The path as typed or chosen; relative paths are relative to FileInput.BaseDirectory."},{"n":"FileInput.FullPath","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#FullPath","s":"FileInput.Text as an absolute path (resolved against FileInput.BaseDirectory), or \u0022\u0022 if the text is empty or not a valid path."},{"n":"FileInput.Mode","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#Mode","s":"Whether a file (the default) or a folder is chosen."},{"n":"FileInput.MustExist","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#MustExist","s":"When true (the default), the file or folder must exist. When false, a new name may be typed, but the folder it would be in must exist; the browser\u0027s Select button then chooses the shown folder with the typed file name."},{"n":"FileInput.Required","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#Required","s":"When true, an empty path is an error; when false (the default), empty means \u0022no file\u0022."},{"n":"FileInput.Filters","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#Filters","s":"File masks offered by the browser, e.g. new FileFilter(\u0022Keys\u0022, \u0022*.pem\u0022, \u0022*.key\u0022) and FileFilter.AllFiles. Empty (the default) shows all files. Ignored in FileInputMode.Folder mode."},{"n":"FileInput.FilterIndex","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#FilterIndex","s":"Index into FileInput.Filters of the filter the browser starts with; the user\u0027s last choice is kept here."},{"n":"FileInput.MatchFilter","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#MatchFilter","s":"When true, a file name that matches none of the FileInput.Filters is an error (default false)."},{"n":"FileInput.BaseDirectory","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#BaseDirectory","s":"Folder that relative paths are resolved against, or null (the default) for the current directory. With FileInput.RelativePaths, chosen paths inside it are written relative to it."},{"n":"FileInput.RelativePaths","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#RelativePaths","s":"When true, a path chosen inside FileInput.BaseDirectory is written relative to it (default false)."},{"n":"FileInput.InitialDirectory","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#InitialDirectory","s":"Folder the browser opens while the field is empty or its folder does not exist, or null (the default) for FileInput.BaseDirectory, then the current directory."},{"n":"FileInput.ShowHidden","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#ShowHidden","s":"Whether the browser lists hidden (and, on Windows, system) files and folders; default false."},{"n":"FileInput.Error","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#Error","s":"Why the current path is not acceptable (in the current language), or null if it is. Checked against the file system each time it is read."},{"n":"FileInput.IsValid","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#IsValid","s":"True if FileInput.Error is null."},{"n":"FileInput.IsDroppedDown","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#IsDroppedDown","s":"True while the file browser is open."},{"n":"FileInput.Font","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#Font","s":"Font of the field and of the browser."},{"n":"FileInput.Color","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#Color","s":"Color of a valid path."},{"n":"FileInput.InvalidColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#InvalidColor","s":"Color of a path that is not valid (see FileInput.Error); dark red by default."},{"n":"FileInput.Background","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#Background","s":"Background of the text field."},{"n":"FileInput.VisualChildren","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#VisualChildren","s":"Children in drawing order: the last one is drawn on top and hit-tested first."},{"n":"FileInput.TextChanged","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#TextChanged","s":"Raised after FileInput.Text changes: typed, chosen in the browser, or set from code."},{"n":"FileInput.FileChosen","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInput.html#FileChosen","s":"Raised after a file or folder was chosen in the browser (after FileInput.TextChanged)."},{"n":"FileInputMode.File","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInputMode.html#File","s":"A file; the browser shows folders and the files that match the selected filter."},{"n":"FileInputMode.Folder","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInputMode.html#Folder","s":"A folder; the browser shows folders only."},{"n":"FileInputMode","k":"enum","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.FileInputMode.html","s":"What a FileInput chooses."},{"n":"GroupBox","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.GroupBox.html","s":"A Panel with a classic etched frame and a GroupBox.Title on its top edge, grouping related controls. Children are placed as in a panel, relative to the group\u0027s top-left corner: leave GroupBox.ContentTop pixels at the top for the title. Disabling the group disables everything in it."},{"n":"GroupBox.OnRender","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.GroupBox.html#OnRender","s":"Draws this control\u0027s own content. (0, 0) is the control\u0027s top-left corner and drawing is clipped to its bounds. Children are drawn by the framework afterwards, on top."},{"n":"GroupBox.GroupBox","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.GroupBox.html#ctor","s":"Creates a group with a title, 200 x 100 pixels."},{"n":"GroupBox.Title","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.GroupBox.html#Title","s":"Text on the top edge of the frame; empty for a plain frame."},{"n":"GroupBox.Font","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.GroupBox.html#Font","s":"Font of the title; Font.Default unless set."},{"n":"GroupBox.Color","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.GroupBox.html#Color","s":"Color of the title."},{"n":"GroupBox.DisabledColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.GroupBox.html#DisabledColor","s":"Color of the title while disabled."},{"n":"GroupBox.ContentTop","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.GroupBox.html#ContentTop","s":"Suggested Y for the first row of children: just below the title."},{"n":"Input","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html","s":"Single-line text editor. Left/Right (Ctrl: by word), Home/End move the caret; with Shift they extend the selection.Click places the caret, Shift\u002Bclick extends the selection, dragging selects.Double click selects a word (dragging then extends by words), triple click selects all.Backspace/Delete (Ctrl: by word) delete the selection or a character.Ctrl\u002BA select all; Ctrl\u002BC / Ctrl\u002BInsert copy; Ctrl\u002BX / Shift\u002BDelete cut; Ctrl\u002BV / Shift\u002BInsert paste. Text wider than the control scrolls to keep the caret visible."},{"n":"Input.Select","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#Select","s":"Selects from start to start \u002B length, where the caret goes. A negative length selects backwards, leaving the caret at the left end."},{"n":"Input.SelectAll","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#SelectAll","s":"Selects the whole text."},{"n":"Input.Copy","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#Copy","s":"Copies the selection to the clipboard. Does nothing if nothing is selected."},{"n":"Input.Cut","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#Cut","s":"Copies the selection to the clipboard and deletes it."},{"n":"Input.Paste","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#Paste","s":"Replaces the selection with the clipboard text (line breaks become spaces)."},{"n":"Input.GetContextMenu","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#GetContextMenu","s":"Context menu with Cut, Copy, Paste and Select all (enabled as they apply), followed by the items of Control.ContextMenu if one is set. Choosing one of those items raises its Click and the user menu\u0027s Closed event as if that menu had been opened; its font and colors are used too."},{"n":"Input.OnTextChanged","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#OnTextChanged","s":""},{"n":"Input.OnGotFocus","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#OnGotFocus","s":""},{"n":"Input.OnLostFocus","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#OnLostFocus","s":""},{"n":"Input.OnMouseDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#OnMouseDown","s":""},{"n":"Input.OnMouseMove","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#OnMouseMove","s":""},{"n":"Input.OnMouseUp","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#OnMouseUp","s":""},{"n":"Input.OnTextInput","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#OnTextInput","s":""},{"n":"Input.OnKeyDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#OnKeyDown","s":""},{"n":"Input.OnRender","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#OnRender","s":"Draws this control\u0027s own content. (0, 0) is the control\u0027s top-left corner and drawing is clipped to its bounds. Children are drawn by the framework afterwards, on top."},{"n":"Input.Input","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#ctor","s":"Creates an empty input, 200 x 30 pixels."},{"n":"Input.MaxLength","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#MaxLength","s":"Most characters (UTF-16 units) the user can type or paste; 0 (the default) means no limit. Pasted text is cut to fit. Text set from code is not shortened."},{"n":"Input.Text","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#Text","s":"The text. Line breaks in assigned text become spaces."},{"n":"Input.CaretIndex","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#CaretIndex","s":"Caret position as an index into Input.Text (0 = before the first character). Setting it clears the selection."},{"n":"Input.SelectionStart","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#SelectionStart","s":"Index of the first selected character."},{"n":"Input.SelectionLength","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#SelectionLength","s":"Number of selected UTF-16 characters; 0 if nothing is selected."},{"n":"Input.SelectedText","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#SelectedText","s":"The selected part of the text."},{"n":"Input.Font","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#Font","s":"Font of the text; Font.Default unless set."},{"n":"Input.Color","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#Color","s":"Text and caret color."},{"n":"Input.Background","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#Background","s":"Background of the text field."},{"n":"Input.DisabledColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#DisabledColor","s":"Text color while disabled."},{"n":"Input.DisabledBackground","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#DisabledBackground","s":"Background while disabled."},{"n":"Input.SelectionBackground","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#SelectionBackground","s":"Background of selected text while the input is focused."},{"n":"Input.SelectionColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#SelectionColor","s":"Color of selected text while the input is focused."},{"n":"Input.InactiveSelectionBackground","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#InactiveSelectionBackground","s":"Background of selected text while the input (or its window) is not focused."},{"n":"Input.TextChanged","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Input.html#TextChanged","s":"Raised after Input.Text changes, by typing or from code."},{"n":"Label","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Label.html","s":"Single- or multi-line (\u0027\\n\u0027) text drawn with one font and color."},{"n":"Label.OnRender","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Label.html#OnRender","s":"Draws this control\u0027s own content. (0, 0) is the control\u0027s top-left corner and drawing is clipped to its bounds. Children are drawn by the framework afterwards, on top."},{"n":"Label.Label","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Label.html#ctor","s":""},{"n":"Label.Text","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Label.html#Text","s":"The text; \u0027\\n\u0027 starts a new line."},{"n":"Label.Font","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Label.html#Font","s":"Font of the text; Font.Default unless set."},{"n":"Label.Color","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Label.html#Color","s":"Text color."},{"n":"Label.DisabledColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Label.html#DisabledColor","s":"Text color used when the label is not Control.IsEffectivelyEnabled."},{"n":"Label.AutoSize","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Label.html#AutoSize","s":"When true (default), Width and Height follow the size of the text."},{"n":"MenuClosedEventArgs","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MenuClosedEventArgs.html","s":"Result of a closed PopupMenu."},{"n":"MenuClosedEventArgs.MenuClosedEventArgs","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MenuClosedEventArgs.html#ctor","s":"Result of a closed PopupMenu."},{"n":"MenuClosedEventArgs.SelectedItem","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MenuClosedEventArgs.html#SelectedItem","s":"The chosen item, or null if the menu was closed without choosing one."},{"n":"MenuItem","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MenuItem.html","s":"An item of a PopupMenu (or a separator)."},{"n":"MenuItem.Separator","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MenuItem.html#Separator","s":"Creates a separator: a line between groups of items."},{"n":"MenuItem.MenuItem","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MenuItem.html#ctor-1","s":"Creates an item without text."},{"n":"MenuItem.MenuItem","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MenuItem.html#ctor-2","s":"Creates an item with a text and an optional shortcut label."},{"n":"MenuItem.Text","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MenuItem.html#Text","s":"Text of the item."},{"n":"MenuItem.ShortcutText","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MenuItem.html#ShortcutText","s":"Shown right-aligned, e.g. \u0022Ctrl\u002BC\u0022. Display only: it does not register a shortcut."},{"n":"MenuItem.Enabled","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MenuItem.html#Enabled","s":"Disabled items are grey and cannot be chosen."},{"n":"MenuItem.IsSeparator","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MenuItem.html#IsSeparator","s":"A separator is a horizontal line between groups of items."},{"n":"MenuItem.Tag","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MenuItem.html#Tag","s":"Any data the application wants to attach."},{"n":"MenuItem.Click","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MenuItem.html#Click","s":"Raised when the item is chosen, before the menu\u0027s Closed event."},{"n":"MessageBox","k":"static class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MessageBox.html","s":"A modal message window: an icon, the text (wrapped to fit) and buttons, in a small dialog window centred over its owner (see Window.ShowModal). While it is open the owner gets no input; Show returns at once and the result arrives in its callback. The first button is the default. Left / Right and Tab / Shift\u002BTab move between the buttons; Enter or Space presses the focused one.Escape and the title bar\u0027s close button answer Cancel (No with MessageBoxButtons.YesNo, OK with MessageBoxButtons.Ok). MessageBox.Show(window, \u0022Save the changes?\u0022, \u0022Settings\u0022, MessageBoxButtons.YesNo, MessageBoxIcon.Question, result =\u003E { if (result == MessageBoxResult.Yes) Save(); });"},{"n":"MessageBox.Show","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MessageBox.html#Show-1","s":"Shows text in a dialog window over owner (lines are broken at \u0027\\n\u0027 and wherever needed). title defaults to the owner\u0027s title, and the owner\u0027s icons are used. closed runs once, with the chosen button, after the message window has closed."},{"n":"MessageBox.Show","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MessageBox.html#Show-2","s":"Shows the message in the window that contains owner (a control shown in a window). See MessageBox.Show."},{"n":"MessageBoxButtons.Ok","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MessageBoxButtons.html#Ok","s":"OK."},{"n":"MessageBoxButtons.OkCancel","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MessageBoxButtons.html#OkCancel","s":"OK and Cancel."},{"n":"MessageBoxButtons.YesNo","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MessageBoxButtons.html#YesNo","s":"Yes and No."},{"n":"MessageBoxButtons.YesNoCancel","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MessageBoxButtons.html#YesNoCancel","s":"Yes, No and Cancel."},{"n":"MessageBoxButtons","k":"enum","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MessageBoxButtons.html","s":"The buttons of a MessageBox."},{"n":"MessageBoxIcon.None","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MessageBoxIcon.html#None","s":"No icon."},{"n":"MessageBoxIcon.Information","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MessageBoxIcon.html#Information","s":"A blue \u0022i\u0022."},{"n":"MessageBoxIcon.Question","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MessageBoxIcon.html#Question","s":"A blue \u0022?\u0022."},{"n":"MessageBoxIcon.Warning","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MessageBoxIcon.html#Warning","s":"A yellow triangle with \u0022!\u0022."},{"n":"MessageBoxIcon.Error","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MessageBoxIcon.html#Error","s":"A red circle with \u0022\u00D7\u0022."},{"n":"MessageBoxIcon","k":"enum","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MessageBoxIcon.html","s":"The icon of a MessageBox."},{"n":"MessageBoxResult.Ok","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MessageBoxResult.html#Ok","s":"OK was chosen."},{"n":"MessageBoxResult.Cancel","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MessageBoxResult.html#Cancel","s":"Cancel was chosen, or the message was closed without a choice (Escape, or the window closed)."},{"n":"MessageBoxResult.Yes","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MessageBoxResult.html#Yes","s":"Yes was chosen."},{"n":"MessageBoxResult.No","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MessageBoxResult.html#No","s":"No was chosen (also Escape with MessageBoxButtons.YesNo)."},{"n":"MessageBoxResult","k":"enum","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.MessageBoxResult.html","s":"The button that closed a MessageBox."},{"n":"NumberInput","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.NumberInput.html","s":"Integer input with classic up / down buttons (a \u0022spin box\u0022). NumberInput.Value always lies in [NumberInput.Min, NumberInput.Max]. Typing accepts only digits (and a leading \u0027-\u0027 when Min is negative) and refuses numbers that can no longer fit the range; a number below Min is allowed while typing and is corrected when the field loses focus or on Enter. The buttons (repeating while held), Up / Down (by NumberInput.Step), PageUp / PageDown (10 steps) and the mouse wheel change the value."},{"n":"NumberInput.OnValueChanged","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.NumberInput.html#OnValueChanged","s":""},{"n":"NumberInput.OnSizeChanged","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.NumberInput.html#OnSizeChanged","s":"Re-applies this control\u0027s anchor and rearranges anchored children, then raises Control.SizeChanged."},{"n":"NumberInput.OnKeyDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.NumberInput.html#OnKeyDown","s":"Up / Down and PageUp / PageDown arrive here from the focused text field (they bubble up)."},{"n":"NumberInput.OnMouseWheel","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.NumberInput.html#OnMouseWheel","s":""},{"n":"NumberInput.OnMouseDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.NumberInput.html#OnMouseDown","s":"Only the buttons get here: the text field covers the rest."},{"n":"NumberInput.OnMouseUp","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.NumberInput.html#OnMouseUp","s":""},{"n":"NumberInput.OnRender","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.NumberInput.html#OnRender","s":"Draws this control\u0027s own content. (0, 0) is the control\u0027s top-left corner and drawing is clipped to its bounds. Children are drawn by the framework afterwards, on top."},{"n":"NumberInput.NumberInput","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.NumberInput.html#ctor","s":"Creates an input with the range 0 to 100, 80 pixels wide."},{"n":"NumberInput.Value","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.NumberInput.html#Value","s":"The number; setting it clamps it into [NumberInput.Min, NumberInput.Max]."},{"n":"NumberInput.Min","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.NumberInput.html#Min","s":"Smallest allowed value (default 0). Raising it above NumberInput.Max raises Max too."},{"n":"NumberInput.Max","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.NumberInput.html#Max","s":"Largest allowed value (default 100). Lowering it below NumberInput.Min lowers Min too."},{"n":"NumberInput.Step","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.NumberInput.html#Step","s":"How much the buttons, Up / Down and the wheel change the value (default 1)."},{"n":"NumberInput.Font","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.NumberInput.html#Font","s":"Font of the number."},{"n":"NumberInput.Color","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.NumberInput.html#Color","s":"Color of the number."},{"n":"NumberInput.Background","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.NumberInput.html#Background","s":"Background of the text field."},{"n":"NumberInput.VisualChildren","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.NumberInput.html#VisualChildren","s":"Children in drawing order: the last one is drawn on top and hit-tested first."},{"n":"NumberInput.ValueChanged","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.NumberInput.html#ValueChanged","s":"Raised after NumberInput.Value changes: from the buttons, keys, wheel, typing or code."},{"n":"Panel","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Panel.html","s":"Container for other controls, positioned by their own X/Y (or Control.Anchor). With Panel.ScrollBars set, the content (the children\u0027s right and bottom edges) can be larger than the panel: classic scroll bars appear when needed, the mouse wheel scrolls (Shift\u002Bwheel horizontally), and a child that gets the keyboard focus is scrolled into view. Anchors then refer to the visible area, without the scroll bars, so stretched children never make the panel scroll."},{"n":"Panel.ScrollIntoView","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Panel.html#ScrollIntoView","s":"Scrolls as little as needed to show descendant (a child, or a child\u0027s child, ...)."},{"n":"Panel.OnScrolled","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Panel.html#OnScrolled","s":""},{"n":"Panel.OnSizeChanged","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Panel.html#OnSizeChanged","s":"Re-applies this control\u0027s anchor and rearranges anchored children, then raises Control.SizeChanged."},{"n":"Panel.OnRender","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Panel.html#OnRender","s":"Draws this control\u0027s own content. (0, 0) is the control\u0027s top-left corner and drawing is clipped to its bounds. Children are drawn by the framework afterwards, on top."},{"n":"Panel.OnMouseDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Panel.html#OnMouseDown","s":""},{"n":"Panel.OnMouseMove","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Panel.html#OnMouseMove","s":""},{"n":"Panel.OnMouseUp","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Panel.html#OnMouseUp","s":""},{"n":"Panel.OnMouseWheel","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Panel.html#OnMouseWheel","s":"The wheel scrolls vertically, or horizontally with Shift (or when there is only a horizontal bar)."},{"n":"Panel.Panel","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Panel.html#ctor","s":"Creates an empty, transparent panel."},{"n":"Panel.Children","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Panel.html#Children","s":"The controls in the panel, drawn in this order (the last one on top)."},{"n":"Panel.Background","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Panel.html#Background","s":"Fill color; transparent by default."},{"n":"Panel.ScrollBars","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Panel.html#ScrollBars","s":"Scroll bars the panel may show; ScrollBars.None (default) never scrolls."},{"n":"Panel.ScrollX","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Panel.html#ScrollX","s":"Horizontal scroll position in pixels: how far the content is moved to the left."},{"n":"Panel.ScrollY","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Panel.html#ScrollY","s":"Vertical scroll position in pixels: how far the content is moved up."},{"n":"Panel.ContentSize","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Panel.html#ContentSize","s":"Size of the content: the right-most and bottom-most edges of the visible children."},{"n":"Panel.VisualChildren","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Panel.html#VisualChildren","s":"Children in drawing order: the last one is drawn on top and hit-tested first."},{"n":"Panel.Scrolled","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Panel.html#Scrolled","s":"Raised after Panel.ScrollX or Panel.ScrollY changes."},{"n":"PopupMenu","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.PopupMenu.html","s":"Menu shown on top of a window\u0027s content, in the classic style. It closes when an item is chosen, on a click outside it, on Escape, or when the window is deactivated or resized; then PopupMenu.Closed reports the chosen item, or null. Items: mouse (left or right button), Up/Down and Enter. Open it with PopupMenu.Show or through Control.ContextMenu."},{"n":"PopupMenu.Show","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.PopupMenu.html#Show","s":"Opens the menu with its top-left corner at (x, y) in owner\u0027s coordinates. onClosed receives the chosen item or null. A menu that is already open, here or elsewhere in the window, is closed first (with null)."},{"n":"PopupMenu.Close","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.PopupMenu.html#Close","s":"Closes the menu without choosing an item."},{"n":"PopupMenu.OnClosed","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.PopupMenu.html#OnClosed","s":""},{"n":"PopupMenu.PopupMenu","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.PopupMenu.html#ctor","s":""},{"n":"PopupMenu.Items","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.PopupMenu.html#Items","s":"Items from top to bottom. An item may also be used in other menus."},{"n":"PopupMenu.Font","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.PopupMenu.html#Font","s":"Font of the items; Font.Default unless set."},{"n":"PopupMenu.Color","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.PopupMenu.html#Color","s":"Text color of the items."},{"n":"PopupMenu.DisabledColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.PopupMenu.html#DisabledColor","s":"Text color of disabled items."},{"n":"PopupMenu.Background","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.PopupMenu.html#Background","s":"Face color of the menu."},{"n":"PopupMenu.SelectionBackground","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.PopupMenu.html#SelectionBackground","s":"Background of the item under the pointer or chosen with the arrow keys."},{"n":"PopupMenu.SelectionColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.PopupMenu.html#SelectionColor","s":"Text color of the highlighted item."},{"n":"PopupMenu.IsOpen","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.PopupMenu.html#IsOpen","s":"True while the menu is shown."},{"n":"PopupMenu.Owner","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.PopupMenu.html#Owner","s":"Control that opened the menu most recently (kept after it closes, e.g. for PopupMenu.Closed handlers)."},{"n":"PopupMenu.Closed","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.PopupMenu.html#Closed","s":"Raised when the menu closes: with the chosen item, or null if it was dismissed."},{"n":"RadioButton","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioButton.html","s":"Option button of a RadioGroup, drawn in the classic style: a sunken circle with a dot. RadioButton.Checked is read from the group. Clicking or Space selects the button; the arrow keys select the next or previous button of the group; the whole group is a single Tab stop. Create RadioButton\u003CT\u003E instances."},{"n":"RadioButton.OnCheckedChanged","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioButton.html#OnCheckedChanged","s":""},{"n":"RadioButton.OnActivated","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioButton.html#OnActivated","s":"Called on a left click or Space: toggles a check box, selects a radio button."},{"n":"RadioButton.OnKeyDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioButton.html#OnKeyDown","s":"Arrow keys: focus and select the previous (Up, Left) or next (Down, Right) button."},{"n":"RadioButton.DrawBox","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioButton.html#DrawBox","s":"Classic sunken circle, built from offset discs: each darker top-left crescent is a disc shifted up and left over a lighter one, the way the classic two-tone ring looks."},{"n":"RadioButton.RadioButton","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioButton.html#ctor","s":"Adds the new button to group."},{"n":"RadioButton.Group","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioButton.html#Group","s":"The group this button belongs to; null after RadioGroup.Remove."},{"n":"RadioButton.Checked","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioButton.html#Checked","s":"True when this is the group\u0027s selected button."},{"n":"RadioButton.BoxSize","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioButton.html#BoxSize","s":"Width and height of the box."},{"n":"RadioButton.IsTabStop","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioButton.html#IsTabStop","s":"Only one button per group is a Tab stop: the checked one, or the first focusable one if none is checked (or the checked one cannot take focus)."},{"n":"RadioButton.CheckedChanged","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioButton.html#CheckedChanged","s":"Raised when this button becomes checked or unchecked, before the group\u0027s ValueChanged."},{"n":"RadioButton\u003CT\u003E","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioButton-1.html","s":"Radio button carrying a RadioButton\u003CT\u003E for its RadioGroup\u003CT\u003E."},{"n":"RadioButton.RadioButton","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioButton-1.html#ctor","s":"Creates a button of group for value."},{"n":"RadioButton.Value","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioButton-1.html#Value","s":"The value the group takes when this button is selected."},{"n":"RadioGroup","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioGroup.html","s":"Non-visual owner of a set of RadioButtons: at most one of them is selected, and the group, not the buttons, holds that state. The buttons can be anywhere in the control tree. Use RadioGroup\u003CT\u003E to give each button a value."},{"n":"RadioGroup.Clear","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioGroup.html#Clear","s":"Unchecks every button."},{"n":"RadioGroup.Remove","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioGroup.html#Remove","s":"Takes button out of the group; it can no longer be checked."},{"n":"RadioGroup.OnValueChanged","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioGroup.html#OnValueChanged","s":""},{"n":"RadioGroup.RadioGroup","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioGroup.html#ctor","s":""},{"n":"RadioGroup.Buttons","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioGroup.html#Buttons","s":"Buttons in the order they were created; arrow keys move through them in this order."},{"n":"RadioGroup.SelectedButton","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioGroup.html#SelectedButton","s":"The checked button, or null if none is."},{"n":"RadioGroup.ValueChanged","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioGroup.html#ValueChanged","s":"Raised after the selection changes, by the user or from code."},{"n":"RadioGroup\u003CT\u003E","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioGroup-1.html","s":"Radio group whose buttons carry values of type T: var size = new RadioGroup\u003CSize\u003E(); panel.Children.Add(new RadioButton\u003CSize\u003E(size, Size.Small, \u0022Small\u0022)); size.ValueChanged \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E Console.WriteLine(size.Value);"},{"n":"RadioGroup.RadioGroup","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioGroup-1.html#ctor","s":""},{"n":"RadioGroup.HasValue","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioGroup-1.html#HasValue","s":"True when a button is selected."},{"n":"RadioGroup.Value","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.RadioGroup-1.html#Value","s":"Value of the selected button; default(T) when none is selected (check RadioGroup\u003CT\u003E). Setting it checks the first button with an equal value, and throws if there is none."},{"n":"Rectangle","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Rectangle.html","s":"Rectangle filled with a solid color."},{"n":"Rectangle.OnRender","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Rectangle.html#OnRender","s":"Draws this control\u0027s own content. (0, 0) is the control\u0027s top-left corner and drawing is clipped to its bounds. Children are drawn by the framework afterwards, on top."},{"n":"Rectangle.Rectangle","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Rectangle.html#ctor","s":""},{"n":"Rectangle.Color","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Rectangle.html#Color","s":"Fill color."},{"n":"ScrollBars.None","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ScrollBars.html#None","s":"Never scrolls."},{"n":"ScrollBars.Vertical","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ScrollBars.html#Vertical","s":"Vertical bar only."},{"n":"ScrollBars.Horizontal","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ScrollBars.html#Horizontal","s":"Horizontal bar only."},{"n":"ScrollBars.Both","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ScrollBars.html#Both","s":"Both bars."},{"n":"ScrollBars","k":"enum","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ScrollBars.html","s":"Which scroll bars a Panel may show when its content does not fit."},{"n":"SplitContainer","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.SplitContainer.html","s":"Two panels separated by a bar that the user drags to share the space between them. Panel1 keeps its size (SplitContainer.SplitterDistance) when the container is resized; Panel2 gets the rest. Neither panel becomes smaller than its minimum size."},{"n":"SplitContainer.OnSplitterMoved","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.SplitContainer.html#OnSplitterMoved","s":""},{"n":"SplitContainer.OnSizeChanged","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.SplitContainer.html#OnSizeChanged","s":"Re-applies this control\u0027s anchor and rearranges anchored children, then raises Control.SizeChanged."},{"n":"SplitContainer.GetCursor","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.SplitContainer.html#GetCursor","s":"Cursor at (x, y) in this control\u0027s coordinates; Control.Cursor by default. Override it to vary the cursor inside the control (e.g. an arrow over a scroll bar)."},{"n":"SplitContainer.OnMouseDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.SplitContainer.html#OnMouseDown","s":""},{"n":"SplitContainer.OnMouseMove","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.SplitContainer.html#OnMouseMove","s":""},{"n":"SplitContainer.OnMouseUp","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.SplitContainer.html#OnMouseUp","s":""},{"n":"SplitContainer.OnRender","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.SplitContainer.html#OnRender","s":"Draws this control\u0027s own content. (0, 0) is the control\u0027s top-left corner and drawing is clipped to its bounds. Children are drawn by the framework afterwards, on top."},{"n":"SplitContainer.SplitContainer","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.SplitContainer.html#ctor","s":"Creates a 400 x 300 container with a vertical bar at 200 pixels."},{"n":"SplitContainer.Panel1","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.SplitContainer.html#Panel1","s":"Left (or top) panel: its size is SplitContainer.SplitterDistance."},{"n":"SplitContainer.Panel2","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.SplitContainer.html#Panel2","s":"Right (or bottom) panel: the remaining space."},{"n":"SplitContainer.Orientation","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.SplitContainer.html#Orientation","s":"Direction of the bar; SplitOrientation.Vertical (left and right panels) by default."},{"n":"SplitContainer.SplitterDistance","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.SplitContainer.html#SplitterDistance","s":"Width (or height) of SplitContainer.Panel1 in pixels, kept within the minimum sizes. The value set is remembered: a Panel1 squeezed by a small container gets its size back when the container grows."},{"n":"SplitContainer.SplitterWidth","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.SplitContainer.html#SplitterWidth","s":"Thickness of the bar (default 5 pixels)."},{"n":"SplitContainer.Panel1MinSize","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.SplitContainer.html#Panel1MinSize","s":"Smallest size of SplitContainer.Panel1 (default 50 pixels)."},{"n":"SplitContainer.Panel2MinSize","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.SplitContainer.html#Panel2MinSize","s":"Smallest size of SplitContainer.Panel2 (default 50 pixels)."},{"n":"SplitContainer.VisualChildren","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.SplitContainer.html#VisualChildren","s":"Children in drawing order: the last one is drawn on top and hit-tested first."},{"n":"SplitContainer.SplitterMoved","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.SplitContainer.html#SplitterMoved","s":"Raised after the user or the program moved the bar."},{"n":"SplitOrientation.Vertical","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.SplitOrientation.html#Vertical","s":"A vertical bar: Panel1 on the left, Panel2 on the right."},{"n":"SplitOrientation.Horizontal","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.SplitOrientation.html#Horizontal","s":"A horizontal bar: Panel1 on top, Panel2 below."},{"n":"SplitOrientation","k":"enum","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.SplitOrientation.html","s":"Direction of the bar of a SplitContainer."},{"n":"TabControl","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabControl.html","s":"Pages with a strip of tabs on top, drawn in the classic (Windows 9x/2000) style. The selected page fills the area below the tabs; the others are hidden. Disabled pages cannot be selected and their tabs are grey; if every page is disabled, no page is selected or shown. Keys (while focus is inside): Ctrl\u002BTab / Ctrl\u002BPageDown next page, Ctrl\u002BShift\u002BTab / Ctrl\u002BPageUp previous."},{"n":"TabControl.OnSelectedPageChanged","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabControl.html#OnSelectedPageChanged","s":""},{"n":"TabControl.OnSizeChanged","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabControl.html#OnSizeChanged","s":"Re-applies this control\u0027s anchor and rearranges anchored children, then raises Control.SizeChanged."},{"n":"TabControl.OnMouseDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabControl.html#OnMouseDown","s":""},{"n":"TabControl.OnKeyDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabControl.html#OnKeyDown","s":""},{"n":"TabControl.OnRender","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabControl.html#OnRender","s":"Draws this control\u0027s own content. (0, 0) is the control\u0027s top-left corner and drawing is clipped to its bounds. Children are drawn by the framework afterwards, on top."},{"n":"TabControl.TabControl","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabControl.html#ctor","s":"Creates an empty tab control, 300 x 200 pixels."},{"n":"TabControl.Pages","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabControl.html#Pages","s":"The pages, in tab order."},{"n":"TabControl.SelectedPage","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabControl.html#SelectedPage","s":"The page that is shown, or null when there are no enabled pages. Setting a disabled page or a page of another TabControl throws; setting null is only allowed when no page is enabled."},{"n":"TabControl.SelectedIndex","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabControl.html#SelectedIndex","s":"Index of TabControl.SelectedPage in TabControl.Pages, or -1."},{"n":"TabControl.Font","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabControl.html#Font","s":"Font of the tab titles; Font.Default unless set."},{"n":"TabControl.Color","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabControl.html#Color","s":"Tab title color."},{"n":"TabControl.DisabledColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabControl.html#DisabledColor","s":"Title color of disabled tabs (drawn embossed, with TabControl.HighlightColor)."},{"n":"TabControl.Background","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabControl.html#Background","s":"Face color of the tabs and the page area."},{"n":"TabControl.HighlightColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabControl.html#HighlightColor","s":"Light edge of the raised 3D border (top and left)."},{"n":"TabControl.ShadowColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabControl.html#ShadowColor","s":"Inner dark edge of the raised 3D border (bottom and right)."},{"n":"TabControl.DarkShadowColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabControl.html#DarkShadowColor","s":"Outer dark edge of the raised 3D border (bottom and right)."},{"n":"TabControl.HeaderHeight","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabControl.html#HeaderHeight","s":"Height of the tab strip."},{"n":"TabControl.PageBounds","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabControl.html#PageBounds","s":"Area of the selected page: below the tabs, inside the 3D border."},{"n":"TabControl.VisualChildren","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabControl.html#VisualChildren","s":"Children in drawing order: the last one is drawn on top and hit-tested first."},{"n":"TabControl.SelectedPageChanged","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabControl.html#SelectedPageChanged","s":"Raised after TabControl.SelectedPage changes."},{"n":"Table","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html","s":"Grid of text cells with a header row, in the classic style. Table.Columns define the headers and widths; Table.Rows hold the cells (see also Table.SetData and Table.AddRow). Every cell uses the table\u0027s Table.Font and Table.Color unless its own are set. Drag a header border to resize a column, double-click it to fit the column to its contents. Scroll bars appear when the cells do not fit; the mouse wheel scrolls (Shift\u002Bwheel horizontally). With Table.RowSelection, a click selects a row (Table.SelectedIndex) and the table takes the keyboard focus: Up / Down, PageUp / PageDown and Home / End move the selection, and Enter or a double click raise Table.RowActivated (e.g. to edit the row)."},{"n":"Table.SetData","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#SetData","s":"Replaces all rows with the texts of data ([row, column])."},{"n":"Table.AddRow","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#AddRow","s":"Adds a row with these cell texts and returns it."},{"n":"Table.CellAt","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#CellAt","s":"Cell under the point (in the table\u0027s coordinates), or null outside the cells."},{"n":"Table.ScrollToRow","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#ScrollToRow","s":"Scrolls vertically so that row is visible."},{"n":"Table.FitColumn","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#FitColumn","s":"Makes column as wide as its header and its widest cell."},{"n":"Table.OnSelectionChanged","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#OnSelectionChanged","s":""},{"n":"Table.OnRowActivated","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#OnRowActivated","s":""},{"n":"Table.OnCellClick","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#OnCellClick","s":""},{"n":"Table.OnCellRightClick","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#OnCellRightClick","s":""},{"n":"Table.OnContextMenuOpening","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#OnContextMenuOpening","s":""},{"n":"Table.GetContextMenu","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#GetContextMenu","s":"The context menu for the cell under the last right-button press, decided by Table.ContextMenuOpening."},{"n":"Table.GetCursor","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#GetCursor","s":"The resize cursor over a header border, and while a column is being resized."},{"n":"Table.OnMouseDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#OnMouseDown","s":""},{"n":"Table.OnKeyDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#OnKeyDown","s":"With Table.RowSelection: arrows, PageUp / PageDown and Home / End select; Enter activates."},{"n":"Table.OnGotFocus","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#OnGotFocus","s":""},{"n":"Table.OnLostFocus","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#OnLostFocus","s":""},{"n":"Table.OnMouseMove","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#OnMouseMove","s":""},{"n":"Table.OnMouseUp","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#OnMouseUp","s":""},{"n":"Table.OnMouseClick","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#OnMouseClick","s":""},{"n":"Table.OnMouseWheel","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#OnMouseWheel","s":""},{"n":"Table.OnRender","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#OnRender","s":"Draws this control\u0027s own content. (0, 0) is the control\u0027s top-left corner and drawing is clipped to its bounds. Children are drawn by the framework afterwards, on top."},{"n":"Table.Table","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#ctor","s":"Creates an empty table, 300 x 200 pixels."},{"n":"Table.Columns","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#Columns","s":"The columns, left to right."},{"n":"Table.Rows","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#Rows","s":"The rows, top to bottom."},{"n":"Table.Item","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#Item","s":"The cell at (row, column); missing cells of a short row are created empty."},{"n":"Table.RowSelection","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#RowSelection","s":"When true, the table has a selected row (Table.SelectedIndex), can take the keyboard focus and moves the selection with the arrow keys. False by default. Turning it off clears the selection."},{"n":"Table.SelectedIndex","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#SelectedIndex","s":"Index of the selected row, or -1 for none. Setting it (needs Table.RowSelection for anything but -1) scrolls the row into view. The selection stays on the same row when rows are inserted or removed before it."},{"n":"Table.SelectedRow","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#SelectedRow","s":"The selected row, or null."},{"n":"Table.SelectionBackground","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#SelectionBackground","s":"Background of the selected row while the table has the focus."},{"n":"Table.SelectionColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#SelectionColor","s":"Text color of the selected row while the table has the focus (cells\u0027 own colors are not used then)."},{"n":"Table.InactiveSelectionBackground","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#InactiveSelectionBackground","s":"Background of the selected row while the table does not have the focus (cells keep their colors)."},{"n":"Table.Font","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#Font","s":"Default font of the cells and the font of the headers."},{"n":"Table.Color","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#Color","s":"Default text color of the cells."},{"n":"Table.Background","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#Background","s":"Background of the cells."},{"n":"Table.GridColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#GridColor","s":"Color of the grid lines."},{"n":"Table.HeaderColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#HeaderColor","s":"Text color of the headers."},{"n":"Table.DisabledColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#DisabledColor","s":"Text color while disabled."},{"n":"Table.CellClick","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#CellClick","s":"Raised on a left click; the indexes are null outside the cells (header, empty area)."},{"n":"Table.CellRightClick","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#CellRightClick","s":"Raised on a right click; the indexes are null outside the cells. The context menu opens after it."},{"n":"Table.ContextMenuOpening","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#ContextMenuOpening","s":"Raised before the context menu opens (right click, or Shift\u002BF10 with no cell). Set TableContextMenuEventArgs.Menu to the menu to show (it starts as Control.ContextMenu), or to null for none."},{"n":"Table.SelectionChanged","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#SelectionChanged","s":"Raised after Table.SelectedIndex changes: by a click, a key, code, or because the selected row was removed."},{"n":"Table.RowActivated","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.Table.html#RowActivated","s":"Raised when a row is double-clicked, or when Enter is pressed on the selected row (which needs Table.RowSelection)."},{"n":"TableCell","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableCell.html","s":"A cell of a Table. TableCell.Font and TableCell.Color are null (use the table\u0027s) unless the program redefines them for this cell."},{"n":"TableCell.ResetStyle","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableCell.html#ResetStyle","s":"Goes back to the table\u0027s font and color."},{"n":"TableCell.Text","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableCell.html#Text","s":"Text of the cell."},{"n":"TableCell.Font","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableCell.html#Font","s":"This cell\u0027s font, or null to use the table\u0027s."},{"n":"TableCell.Color","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableCell.html#Color","s":"This cell\u0027s text color, or null to use the table\u0027s."},{"n":"TableCell.IsStyled","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableCell.html#IsStyled","s":"True if the cell has its own font or color."},{"n":"TableCellEventArgs","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableCellEventArgs.html","s":"A click on a Table: the cell\u0027s indexes, or null outside the cells."},{"n":"TableCellEventArgs.TableCellEventArgs","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableCellEventArgs.html#ctor","s":"A click on a Table: the cell\u0027s indexes, or null outside the cells."},{"n":"TableCellEventArgs.Row","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableCellEventArgs.html#Row","s":"Row index of the clicked cell, or null outside the cells."},{"n":"TableCellEventArgs.Column","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableCellEventArgs.html#Column","s":"Column index of the clicked cell, or null outside the cells."},{"n":"TableCellEventArgs.Button","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableCellEventArgs.html#Button","s":"The mouse button that was clicked."},{"n":"TableColumn","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableColumn.html","s":"A column of a TableColumn.Table: its header text and width."},{"n":"TableColumn.TableColumn","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableColumn.html#ctor","s":"Creates a column with a header text and a width in pixels."},{"n":"TableColumn.Header","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableColumn.html#Header","s":"Header text."},{"n":"TableColumn.Width","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableColumn.html#Width","s":"Width in pixels; the user can change it by dragging the header border."},{"n":"TableColumn.MinWidth","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableColumn.html#MinWidth","s":"Smallest width the user can drag the column to (default 20)."},{"n":"TableColumnCollection","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableColumnCollection.html","s":"Columns of a Table."},{"n":"TableContextMenuEventArgs","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableContextMenuEventArgs.html","s":"The context menu of a Table is about to open for a cell (or outside the cells: null indexes)."},{"n":"TableContextMenuEventArgs.TableContextMenuEventArgs","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableContextMenuEventArgs.html#ctor","s":"The context menu of a Table is about to open for a cell (or outside the cells: null indexes)."},{"n":"TableContextMenuEventArgs.Row","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableContextMenuEventArgs.html#Row","s":"Row index of the right-clicked cell, or null outside the cells."},{"n":"TableContextMenuEventArgs.Column","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableContextMenuEventArgs.html#Column","s":"Column index of the right-clicked cell, or null outside the cells."},{"n":"TableContextMenuEventArgs.Menu","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableContextMenuEventArgs.html#Menu","s":"The menu to show; starts as the table\u0027s ContextMenu. Set it to null to show none."},{"n":"TableRow","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableRow.html","s":"A row of a TableRow.Table: its cells, in column order."},{"n":"TableRow.TableRow","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableRow.html#ctor","s":"Creates a row with these cell texts."},{"n":"TableRow.Item","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableRow.html#Item","s":"The cell in column; cells missing at the end of the row are created empty."},{"n":"TableRow.CellCount","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableRow.html#CellCount","s":"Number of cells the row has (it may differ from the number of columns)."},{"n":"TableRowCollection","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableRowCollection.html","s":"Rows of a Table."},{"n":"TableRowEventArgs","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableRowEventArgs.html","s":"A row of a Table was activated (double click, or Enter on the selected row)."},{"n":"TableRowEventArgs.TableRowEventArgs","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableRowEventArgs.html#ctor","s":"A row of a Table was activated (double click, or Enter on the selected row)."},{"n":"TableRowEventArgs.Row","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TableRowEventArgs.html#Row","s":"Index of the activated row."},{"n":"TabPage","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabPage.html","s":"A page of a TabControl: a Panel whose TabPage.Title is shown on its tab. While it belongs to a TabControl, its Control.Visible and Control.Bounds are managed by the TabControl; set Control.Enabled to false to make it unselectable."},{"n":"TabPage.TabPage","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabPage.html#ctor-1","s":"Creates a page without a title."},{"n":"TabPage.TabPage","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabPage.html#ctor-2","s":"Creates a page with a title."},{"n":"TabPage.Title","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabPage.html#Title","s":"Text of the page\u0027s tab."},{"n":"TabPageCollection","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TabPageCollection.html","s":"Pages of a TabControl, in tab order."},{"n":"TextArea","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html","s":"Multi-line text editor in the classic style (sunken edge, vertical scroll bar when needed). Enter starts a new line; Tab still moves the focus to the next control.Left/Right (Ctrl: by word), Up/Down, Home/End (Ctrl: whole text), PageUp/PageDown; with Shift they select.Click places the caret, Shift\u002Bclick and dragging select, double click selects a word, triple click a line.Backspace/Delete (Ctrl: by word); Ctrl\u002BA/C/X/V, Ctrl\u002BInsert, Shift\u002BInsert, Shift\u002BDelete; context menu.Mouse wheel and the scroll bar scroll; the view follows the caret (also horizontally). Lines are separated by \u0027\\n\u0027; \u0022\\r\\n\u0022 and \u0022\\r\u0022 in assigned or pasted text become \u0027\\n\u0027. No word wrap."},{"n":"TextArea.Select","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#Select","s":"Selects from start to start \u002B length, where the caret goes; a negative length selects backwards."},{"n":"TextArea.SelectAll","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#SelectAll","s":"Selects the whole text."},{"n":"TextArea.Copy","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#Copy","s":"Copies the selection to the clipboard."},{"n":"TextArea.Cut","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#Cut","s":"Copies the selection to the clipboard and deletes it."},{"n":"TextArea.Paste","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#Paste","s":"Replaces the selection with the clipboard text."},{"n":"TextArea.ScrollToCaret","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#ScrollToCaret","s":"Scrolls so that the caret is visible."},{"n":"TextArea.OnTextChanged","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#OnTextChanged","s":""},{"n":"TextArea.OnSelectionChanged","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#OnSelectionChanged","s":""},{"n":"TextArea.GetContextMenu","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#GetContextMenu","s":"Returns the menu to open as the context menu; Control.ContextMenu by default. Override it to supply a different menu, e.g. one with the control\u0027s own commands followed by the user\u0027s items."},{"n":"TextArea.GetCursor","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#GetCursor","s":"Text cursor over the text, the arrow over the scroll bar."},{"n":"TextArea.OnSizeChanged","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#OnSizeChanged","s":"Re-applies this control\u0027s anchor and rearranges anchored children, then raises Control.SizeChanged."},{"n":"TextArea.OnGotFocus","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#OnGotFocus","s":""},{"n":"TextArea.OnLostFocus","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#OnLostFocus","s":""},{"n":"TextArea.OnMouseDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#OnMouseDown","s":""},{"n":"TextArea.OnMouseMove","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#OnMouseMove","s":""},{"n":"TextArea.OnMouseUp","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#OnMouseUp","s":""},{"n":"TextArea.OnMouseWheel","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#OnMouseWheel","s":""},{"n":"TextArea.OnTextInput","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#OnTextInput","s":""},{"n":"TextArea.OnKeyDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#OnKeyDown","s":""},{"n":"TextArea.OnRender","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#OnRender","s":"Draws this control\u0027s own content. (0, 0) is the control\u0027s top-left corner and drawing is clipped to its bounds. Children are drawn by the framework afterwards, on top."},{"n":"TextArea.TextArea","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#ctor","s":"Creates an empty text area, 300 x 150 pixels."},{"n":"TextArea.Text","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#Text","s":"The text; lines are separated by \u0027\\n\u0027."},{"n":"TextArea.LineCount","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#LineCount","s":"Number of lines (at least 1)."},{"n":"TextArea.CaretIndex","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#CaretIndex","s":"Caret position as an index into TextArea.Text. Setting it clears the selection."},{"n":"TextArea.CaretLine","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#CaretLine","s":"Zero-based line of the caret."},{"n":"TextArea.CaretColumn","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#CaretColumn","s":"Zero-based column (UTF-16 characters from the start of the line) of the caret."},{"n":"TextArea.SelectionStart","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#SelectionStart","s":"Index of the first selected character."},{"n":"TextArea.SelectionLength","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#SelectionLength","s":"Number of selected characters; 0 when nothing is selected."},{"n":"TextArea.SelectedText","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#SelectedText","s":"The selected part of the text."},{"n":"TextArea.Font","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#Font","s":"Font of the text; Font.Default unless set."},{"n":"TextArea.Color","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#Color","s":"Text and caret color."},{"n":"TextArea.Background","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#Background","s":"Background of the text."},{"n":"TextArea.DisabledColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#DisabledColor","s":"Text color while disabled."},{"n":"TextArea.DisabledBackground","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#DisabledBackground","s":"Background while disabled."},{"n":"TextArea.SelectionBackground","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#SelectionBackground","s":"Background of selected text while focused."},{"n":"TextArea.SelectionColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#SelectionColor","s":"Color of selected text while focused."},{"n":"TextArea.InactiveSelectionBackground","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#InactiveSelectionBackground","s":"Background of selected text while not focused."},{"n":"TextArea.TextChanged","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#TextChanged","s":"Raised after TextArea.Text changes, by typing or from code."},{"n":"TextArea.SelectionChanged","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TextArea.html#SelectionChanged","s":"Raised after the caret moves or the selection changes."},{"n":"ToggleControl","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html","s":"Base of CheckBox and RadioButton: a small classic box followed by text. A left click (on the box or the text) or Space while focused calls ToggleControl.OnActivated."},{"n":"ToggleControl.OnActivated","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html#OnActivated","s":"Called on a left click or Space: toggles a check box, selects a radio button."},{"n":"ToggleControl.DrawBox","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html#DrawBox","s":"Draws the box (edge, inside and mark) into box."},{"n":"ToggleControl.OnMouseDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html#OnMouseDown","s":""},{"n":"ToggleControl.OnMouseUp","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html#OnMouseUp","s":""},{"n":"ToggleControl.OnMouseClick","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html#OnMouseClick","s":""},{"n":"ToggleControl.OnMouseEnter","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html#OnMouseEnter","s":""},{"n":"ToggleControl.OnMouseLeave","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html#OnMouseLeave","s":""},{"n":"ToggleControl.OnKeyDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html#OnKeyDown","s":""},{"n":"ToggleControl.OnGotFocus","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html#OnGotFocus","s":""},{"n":"ToggleControl.OnLostFocus","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html#OnLostFocus","s":""},{"n":"ToggleControl.OnRender","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html#OnRender","s":"Draws this control\u0027s own content. (0, 0) is the control\u0027s top-left corner and drawing is clipped to its bounds. Children are drawn by the framework afterwards, on top."},{"n":"ToggleControl.ToggleControl","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html#ctor","s":"Makes the control focusable and sizes it to its box."},{"n":"ToggleControl.Text","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html#Text","s":"Text shown right of the box."},{"n":"ToggleControl.Font","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html#Font","s":"Font of the text; Font.Default unless set."},{"n":"ToggleControl.AutoSize","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html#AutoSize","s":"When true (default), Width and Height follow the box and the text."},{"n":"ToggleControl.IsPressed","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html#IsPressed","s":"True while the left button is held after being pressed on the control."},{"n":"ToggleControl.Color","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html#Color","s":"Text and mark color."},{"n":"ToggleControl.DisabledColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html#DisabledColor","s":"Text and mark color when disabled (the text is embossed with ToggleControl.HighlightColor)."},{"n":"ToggleControl.BoxColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html#BoxColor","s":"Inside of the box."},{"n":"ToggleControl.FaceColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html#FaceColor","s":"Inside of the box while pressed or disabled, and the inner light edge."},{"n":"ToggleControl.HighlightColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html#HighlightColor","s":"Light edge of the sunken box."},{"n":"ToggleControl.ShadowColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html#ShadowColor","s":"Outer dark edge of the sunken box."},{"n":"ToggleControl.DarkShadowColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html#DarkShadowColor","s":"Inner dark edge of the sunken box."},{"n":"ToggleControl.BoxSize","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.ToggleControl.html#BoxSize","s":"Width and height of the box."},{"n":"TreeNode","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeNode.html","s":"A node of a TreeNode.TreeView: its text, its child TreeNode.Nodes and any application data in TreeNode.Tag."},{"n":"TreeNode.Expand","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeNode.html#Expand","s":"Shows the children."},{"n":"TreeNode.Collapse","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeNode.html#Collapse","s":"Hides the children."},{"n":"TreeNode.Toggle","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeNode.html#Toggle","s":"Expands a collapsed node, collapses an expanded one."},{"n":"TreeNode.ExpandAll","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeNode.html#ExpandAll","s":"Expands this node and all nodes below it."},{"n":"TreeNode.ToString","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeNode.html#ToString","s":"The node\u0027s text."},{"n":"TreeNode.TreeNode","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeNode.html#ctor","s":"Creates a node with a text and child nodes."},{"n":"TreeNode.Text","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeNode.html#Text","s":"Text shown for the node."},{"n":"TreeNode.Nodes","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeNode.html#Nodes","s":"Child nodes."},{"n":"TreeNode.Parent","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeNode.html#Parent","s":"The parent node, or null for a top-level node."},{"n":"TreeNode.TreeView","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeNode.html#TreeView","s":"The tree view the node is shown in, or null while it is not part of one."},{"n":"TreeNode.Level","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeNode.html#Level","s":"Depth: 0 for a top-level node."},{"n":"TreeNode.Tag","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeNode.html#Tag","s":"Any data the application wants to keep with the node."},{"n":"TreeNode.IsExpanded","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeNode.html#IsExpanded","s":"Whether the children are shown. Collapsing a node that contains the selection selects the node."},{"n":"TreeNodeCollection","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeNodeCollection.html","s":"Children of a TreeNode, or the top-level nodes of a TreeNodeCollection.TreeView."},{"n":"TreeView","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeView.html","s":"Hierarchy of TreeNodes in the classic style: dotted lines, [\u002B] / [-] boxes and a highlighted selection. Click a node to select it, its box (or double-click it) to expand or collapse it. Keys: Up / Down / Home / End / PageUp / PageDown move the selection; Right expands (then goes to the first child); Left collapses (then goes to the parent); Enter toggles. Scroll bars appear when needed."},{"n":"TreeView.ScrollIntoView","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeView.html#ScrollIntoView","s":"Scrolls so that node (which must be visible, i.e. its parents expanded) is shown."},{"n":"TreeView.OnSelectionChanged","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeView.html#OnSelectionChanged","s":""},{"n":"TreeView.OnMouseDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeView.html#OnMouseDown","s":""},{"n":"TreeView.OnMouseMove","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeView.html#OnMouseMove","s":""},{"n":"TreeView.OnMouseUp","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeView.html#OnMouseUp","s":""},{"n":"TreeView.OnMouseWheel","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeView.html#OnMouseWheel","s":""},{"n":"TreeView.OnKeyDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeView.html#OnKeyDown","s":""},{"n":"TreeView.OnGotFocus","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeView.html#OnGotFocus","s":""},{"n":"TreeView.OnLostFocus","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeView.html#OnLostFocus","s":""},{"n":"TreeView.OnRender","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeView.html#OnRender","s":"Draws this control\u0027s own content. (0, 0) is the control\u0027s top-left corner and drawing is clipped to its bounds. Children are drawn by the framework afterwards, on top."},{"n":"TreeView.TreeView","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeView.html#ctor","s":"Creates an empty tree view, 200 x 240 pixels."},{"n":"TreeView.Nodes","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeView.html#Nodes","s":"The top-level nodes."},{"n":"TreeView.SelectedNode","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeView.html#SelectedNode","s":"The selected node, or null. Setting a node expands its parents and scrolls it into view; it must belong to this tree view."},{"n":"TreeView.Font","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeView.html#Font","s":"Font of the node texts; Font.Default unless set."},{"n":"TreeView.Color","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeView.html#Color","s":"Text color."},{"n":"TreeView.DisabledColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeView.html#DisabledColor","s":"Text color while disabled."},{"n":"TreeView.Background","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeView.html#Background","s":"Background color."},{"n":"TreeView.LineColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeView.html#LineColor","s":"Color of the dotted lines and of the expand boxes\u0027 frames."},{"n":"TreeView.SelectionBackground","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeView.html#SelectionBackground","s":"Background of the selected node while the tree view has the focus."},{"n":"TreeView.SelectionColor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeView.html#SelectionColor","s":"Text color of the selected node while the tree view has the focus."},{"n":"TreeView.InactiveSelectionBackground","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeView.html#InactiveSelectionBackground","s":"Background of the selected node while the tree view does not have the focus."},{"n":"TreeView.SelectionChanged","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.Controls.TreeView.html#SelectionChanged","s":"Raised after TreeView.SelectedNode changes, by the user or from code."},{"n":"DoquaInfo","k":"static class","u":"api/Doqua.Core.DoquaInfo.html","s":"Information about the Doqua library."},{"n":"DoquaInfo.Version","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.Core.DoquaInfo.html#Version","s":"The library\u0027s assembly version."},{"n":"DoquaInfo.Name","k":"field","u":"api/Doqua.Core.DoquaInfo.html#Name","s":"The library\u0027s name."},{"n":"Anchor","k":"record struct","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Anchor.html","s":"Distances in pixels that a control keeps from its parent\u0027s edges when the parent is resized. For each axis: Left and Right: X = Left and the width stretches so that X \u002B Width \u002B Right = parent width.only Left: X = Left, the width is unchanged.only Right: the width is unchanged and X moves so that X \u002B Width \u002B Right = parent width.neither: X and Width are left alone. Top and Bottom work the same way vertically. Example: new Anchor(Right: 10, Bottom: 10) keeps a control in the bottom-right corner."},{"n":"Anchor.Fill","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Anchor.html#Fill","s":"Fills the parent, leaving margin pixels on every side."},{"n":"Anchor.Anchor","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Anchor.html#ctor","s":"Distances in pixels that a control keeps from its parent\u0027s edges when the parent is resized. For each axis: Left and Right: X = Left and the width stretches so that X \u002B Width \u002B Right = parent width.only Left: X = Left, the width is unchanged.only Right: the width is unchanged and X moves so that X \u002B Width \u002B Right = parent width.neither: X and Width are left alone. Top and Bottom work the same way vertically. Example: new Anchor(Right: 10, Bottom: 10) keeps a control in the bottom-right corner."},{"n":"Anchor.Left","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Anchor.html#Left","s":""},{"n":"Anchor.Top","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Anchor.html#Top","s":""},{"n":"Anchor.Right","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Anchor.html#Right","s":""},{"n":"Anchor.Bottom","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Anchor.html#Bottom","s":""},{"n":"Anchor.None","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Anchor.html#None","s":"No anchoring: the control keeps its bounds."},{"n":"Anchor.IsNone","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Anchor.html#IsNone","s":"True when no edge is set: the control is neither moved nor resized."},{"n":"Application","k":"static class","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Application.html","s":"Runs the application: shows the main window and processes events until it is closed. Windows, controls and timers belong to the GUI thread: the thread that creates the first Window and calls Application.Run. Other threads hand work to it with Application.Post or Application.InvokeAsync; on the GUI thread, await comes back to the GUI thread by itself (see Application.IsGuiThread)."},{"n":"Application.Run","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Application.html#Run","s":"Shows mainWindow and runs the event loop until it is closed. Must be called from the thread that created the windows."},{"n":"Application.Post","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Application.html#Post","s":"Runs action on the GUI thread, soon: between events, in the order the actions were posted. Can be called from any thread (also from the GUI thread) and returns at once. An exception thrown by the action is treated like one thrown by an event handler. Actions posted after Application.Run has returned never run. // On a thread that reads from the network: var value = socket.ReadValue(); Application.Post(() =\u003E valueLabel.Text = value.ToString());"},{"n":"Application.InvokeAsync","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Application.html#InvokeAsync-1","s":"Runs action on the GUI thread (see Application.Post); the task completes after it has run, or fails with its exception."},{"n":"Application.InvokeAsync","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Application.html#InvokeAsync-2","s":"Runs function on the GUI thread (see Application.Post) and gives its result, e.g. a value a background thread needs from a control: var port = await Application.InvokeAsync(() =\u003E portInput.Text);"},{"n":"Application.MainWindow","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Application.html#MainWindow","s":"The window passed to Application.Run, or null before it is called."},{"n":"Application.IsGuiThread","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Application.html#IsGuiThread","s":"True on the GUI thread, and on any thread before the first window has been created. Code on other threads must not touch windows, shown controls or timers; it can Application.Post the work instead."},{"n":"Bitmap","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Bitmap.html","s":"Image in memory: 32-bit pixels with an alpha channel. Loads PNG files."},{"n":"Bitmap.Load","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Bitmap.html#Load-1","s":"Loads a PNG file."},{"n":"Bitmap.Load","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Bitmap.html#Load-2","s":"Loads a PNG image from a stream."},{"n":"Bitmap.Save","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Bitmap.html#Save-1","s":"Saves the bitmap as a PNG file (RGB if every pixel is opaque, otherwise RGBA)."},{"n":"Bitmap.Save","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Bitmap.html#Save-2","s":"Writes the bitmap to a stream in PNG format."},{"n":"Bitmap.CreateDrawingContext","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Bitmap.html#CreateDrawingContext","s":"Creates a DrawingContext that draws into this bitmap: (0, 0) is its top-left pixel and drawing is clipped to its size. Translucent drawing blends with the bitmap\u0027s own alpha."},{"n":"Bitmap.GetPixel","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Bitmap.html#GetPixel","s":"Color of the pixel at (x, y)."},{"n":"Bitmap.SetPixel","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Bitmap.html#SetPixel","s":"Sets the pixel at (x, y) to color, without blending."},{"n":"Bitmap.Draw","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Bitmap.html#Draw-1","s":"Draws source (the whole bitmap if null) at its natural size, with its top-left corner at (x, y)."},{"n":"Bitmap.Draw","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Bitmap.html#Draw-2","s":"Draws source (the whole bitmap if null) scaled to fill destination."},{"n":"Bitmap.Bitmap","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Bitmap.html#ctor","s":"Creates a transparent bitmap."},{"n":"Bitmap.Width","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Bitmap.html#Width","s":"Width in pixels."},{"n":"Bitmap.Height","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Bitmap.html#Height","s":"Height in pixels."},{"n":"Clipboard","k":"static class","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Clipboard.html","s":"System clipboard (text only). Call from the GUI thread (see Application.Post)."},{"n":"Clipboard.GetText","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Clipboard.html#GetText","s":"Returns the clipboard text, or null if the clipboard holds no text."},{"n":"Clipboard.SetText","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Clipboard.html#SetText","s":"Puts text on the clipboard. Returns false if the clipboard is unavailable."},{"n":"Color","k":"record struct","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Color.html","s":"Color with red, green, blue and alpha (opacity) components, 0 to 255 each."},{"n":"Color.FromRgb","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Color.html#FromRgb","s":"Creates an opaque color from 0xRRGGBB."},{"n":"Color.Lerp","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Color.html#Lerp","s":"Mixes two colors: amount 0 gives from, 1 gives to."},{"n":"Color.ToString","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Color.html#ToString","s":"The color\u0027s name if it is one of the named colors, otherwise #RRGGBB (#AARRGGBB when translucent)."},{"n":"Color.Color","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Color.html#ctor","s":"Color with red, green, blue and alpha (opacity) components, 0 to 255 each."},{"n":"Color.R","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Color.html#R","s":"Red."},{"n":"Color.G","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Color.html#G","s":"Green."},{"n":"Color.B","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Color.html#B","s":"Blue."},{"n":"Color.A","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Color.html#A","s":"Alpha: 0 is fully transparent, 255 (the default) opaque."},{"n":"Color.Transparent","k":"field","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Color.html#Transparent","s":"Fully transparent (alpha 0)."},{"n":"Color.Black","k":"field","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Color.html#Black","s":"Black (0, 0, 0)."},{"n":"Color.White","k":"field","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Color.html#White","s":"White (255, 255, 255)."},{"n":"Color.Gray","k":"field","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Color.html#Gray","s":"Gray (128, 128, 128)."},{"n":"Color.LightGray","k":"field","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Color.html#LightGray","s":"Light gray (211, 211, 211)."},{"n":"Color.Red","k":"field","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Color.html#Red","s":"Red (255, 0, 0)."},{"n":"Color.Green","k":"field","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Color.html#Green","s":"Green (0, 128, 0)."},{"n":"Color.Blue","k":"field","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Color.html#Blue","s":"Blue (0, 0, 255)."},{"n":"Color.LightBlue","k":"field","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Color.html#LightBlue","s":"Light blue (173, 216, 230)."},{"n":"Color.Yellow","k":"field","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Color.html#Yellow","s":"Yellow (255, 255, 0)."},{"n":"Color.Orange","k":"field","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Color.html#Orange","s":"Orange (255, 165, 0)."},{"n":"Color.Purple","k":"field","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Color.html#Purple","s":"Purple (128, 0, 128)."},{"n":"Control","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html","s":"Base class of all visual components. Control.X and Control.Y are relative to the parent."},{"n":"Control.Focus","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#Focus","s":"Moves keyboard focus to this control. Returns false if it Control.CanFocus not."},{"n":"Control.Invalidate","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#Invalidate","s":"Requests a redraw of the window that contains this control."},{"n":"Control.OnRender","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#OnRender","s":"Draws this control\u0027s own content. (0, 0) is the control\u0027s top-left corner and drawing is clipped to its bounds. Children are drawn by the framework afterwards, on top."},{"n":"Control.OnMouseDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#OnMouseDown","s":""},{"n":"Control.OnMouseUp","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#OnMouseUp","s":""},{"n":"Control.OnMouseClick","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#OnMouseClick","s":""},{"n":"Control.OnMouseMove","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#OnMouseMove","s":""},{"n":"Control.OnMouseWheel","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#OnMouseWheel","s":""},{"n":"Control.OnMouseEnter","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#OnMouseEnter","s":""},{"n":"Control.OnMouseLeave","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#OnMouseLeave","s":""},{"n":"Control.OnSizeChanged","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#OnSizeChanged","s":"Re-applies this control\u0027s anchor and rearranges anchored children, then raises Control.SizeChanged."},{"n":"Control.GetContextMenu","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#GetContextMenu","s":"Returns the menu to open as the context menu; Control.ContextMenu by default. Override it to supply a different menu, e.g. one with the control\u0027s own commands followed by the user\u0027s items."},{"n":"Control.GetCursor","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#GetCursor","s":"Cursor at (x, y) in this control\u0027s coordinates; Control.Cursor by default. Override it to vary the cursor inside the control (e.g. an arrow over a scroll bar)."},{"n":"Control.OnVisibleChanged","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#OnVisibleChanged","s":""},{"n":"Control.OnEnabledChanged","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#OnEnabledChanged","s":""},{"n":"Control.OnGotFocus","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#OnGotFocus","s":""},{"n":"Control.OnLostFocus","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#OnLostFocus","s":""},{"n":"Control.OnKeyDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#OnKeyDown","s":""},{"n":"Control.OnTextInput","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#OnTextInput","s":""},{"n":"Control.Control","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#ctor","s":""},{"n":"Control.Name","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#Name","s":"Optional name, for the application\u0027s own use."},{"n":"Control.Parent","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#Parent","s":"The container this control is in, or null."},{"n":"Control.X","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#X","s":"Left edge, relative to the parent."},{"n":"Control.Y","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#Y","s":"Top edge, relative to the parent."},{"n":"Control.Width","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#Width","s":"Width in pixels."},{"n":"Control.Height","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#Height","s":"Height in pixels."},{"n":"Control.Bounds","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#Bounds","s":"Position (relative to the parent) and size, together."},{"n":"Control.Anchor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#Anchor","s":"Keeps the control at fixed distances from its parent\u0027s edges; see Anchor. Applied when the parent is resized, when the control gets a parent or changes size, and when set."},{"n":"Control.Visible","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#Visible","s":"When false, the control and its children are not drawn and ignore the mouse."},{"n":"Control.Enabled","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#Enabled","s":"When false, the control and its children are still drawn (usually in disabled colors) but get no mouse events. They still cover controls below them, so clicks do not pass through."},{"n":"Control.IsEffectivelyVisible","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#IsEffectivelyVisible","s":"True if this control and all its parents are visible."},{"n":"Control.IsEffectivelyEnabled","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#IsEffectivelyEnabled","s":"True if this control and all its parents are enabled."},{"n":"Control.Focusable","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#Focusable","s":"Whether the control can receive keyboard focus (by click, Tab or Control.Focus)."},{"n":"Control.Focused","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#Focused","s":"True if this control is its window\u0027s Window.FocusedControl."},{"n":"Control.CanFocus","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#CanFocus","s":"Focusable, visible and enabled (with all parents), and shown in a window."},{"n":"Control.IsMouseOver","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#IsMouseOver","s":"True while the mouse pointer is over this control (and not over one of its children)."},{"n":"Control.Cursor","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#Cursor","s":"Mouse pointer shape over this control. Cursor.Default (the default) uses the parent\u0027s cursor, and the arrow at the top of the tree. See Control.GetCursor."},{"n":"Control.ContextMenu","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#ContextMenu","s":"Menu opened by a right click on this control (or on a child without its own menu) and by Shift\u002BF10 while the control has focus. See Control.GetContextMenu."},{"n":"Control.IsTabStop","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#IsTabStop","s":"Whether Tab / Shift\u002BTab stops at this focusable control. A radio button returns false unless it is the one that represents its group, so a whole group is a single Tab stop."},{"n":"Control.VisualChildren","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#VisualChildren","s":"Children in drawing order: the last one is drawn on top and hit-tested first."},{"n":"Control.VisibleChanged","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#VisibleChanged","s":"Raised when a mouse button is pressed over this control."},{"n":"Control.EnabledChanged","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#EnabledChanged","s":"Raised after Control.Enabled changed (not when only a parent\u0027s Enabled changed)."},{"n":"Control.SizeChanged","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#SizeChanged","s":"Raised after Width or Height changed; anchored children have already been rearranged."},{"n":"Control.MouseDown","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#MouseDown","s":"Raised when a mouse button is pressed over this control."},{"n":"Control.MouseUp","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#MouseUp","s":"Raised when a mouse button pressed over this control is released, even if the pointer has moved away or the control was disabled meanwhile: every MouseDown gets its MouseUp."},{"n":"Control.MouseClick","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#MouseClick","s":"Raised when a mouse button is pressed and released over this control."},{"n":"Control.MouseMove","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#MouseMove","s":"Raised when the pointer moves over this control, or anywhere while a mouse button pressed over this control is held (so dragging keeps reporting positions)."},{"n":"Control.MouseWheel","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#MouseWheel","s":"Raised when the mouse wheel turns over this control or one of its children (until handled)."},{"n":"Control.MouseEnter","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#MouseEnter","s":"Raised when the pointer moves onto this control."},{"n":"Control.GotFocus","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#GotFocus","s":"Raised when the control receives the keyboard focus."},{"n":"Control.LostFocus","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#LostFocus","s":"Raised when the control loses the keyboard focus."},{"n":"Control.KeyDown","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#KeyDown","s":"Raised when a key is pressed while this control or one of its children is focused. Goes from the focused control up through its parents until handled."},{"n":"Control.TextInput","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#TextInput","s":"Raised with typed text; routed like Control.KeyDown."},{"n":"Control.MouseLeave","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Control.html#MouseLeave","s":"Raised after Control.MouseEnter when the pointer leaves, even if the control was disabled meanwhile."},{"n":"ControlCollection","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.ControlCollection.html","s":"Children of a container. Keeps Control.Parent in sync."},{"n":"Cursor.Default","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Cursor.html#Default","s":"The parent\u0027s cursor (the arrow at the top of the tree)."},{"n":"Cursor.Arrow","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Cursor.html#Arrow","s":"The standard arrow."},{"n":"Cursor.IBeam","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Cursor.html#IBeam","s":"Text cursor, for places where text can be selected or typed."},{"n":"Cursor.Hand","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Cursor.html#Hand","s":"Pointing hand, for links."},{"n":"Cursor.Wait","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Cursor.html#Wait","s":"Busy."},{"n":"Cursor.Crosshair","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Cursor.html#Crosshair","s":"Crosshair, for picking precise positions."},{"n":"Cursor.SizeWE","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Cursor.html#SizeWE","s":"Resize horizontally (west-east)."},{"n":"Cursor.SizeNS","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Cursor.html#SizeNS","s":"Resize vertically (north-south)."},{"n":"Cursor.SizeNWSE","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Cursor.html#SizeNWSE","s":"Resize diagonally (north-west to south-east)."},{"n":"Cursor.SizeNESW","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Cursor.html#SizeNESW","s":"Resize diagonally (north-east to south-west)."},{"n":"Cursor.SizeAll","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Cursor.html#SizeAll","s":"Move in any direction."},{"n":"Cursor.No","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Cursor.html#No","s":"Action not allowed."},{"n":"Cursor","k":"enum","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Cursor.html","s":"Mouse pointer shape shown over a control."},{"n":"DrawingContext","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.DrawingContext.html","s":"Draws into a window\u0027s framebuffer (in Control rendering) or into a Bitmap (Bitmap.CreateDrawingContext). While rendering a control, coordinates are local to the control and drawing is clipped to its bounds."},{"n":"DrawingContext.FillRectangle","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.DrawingContext.html#FillRectangle-1","s":"Fills a rectangle (in the current control\u0027s coordinates) with color; translucent colors are blended."},{"n":"DrawingContext.FillRectangle","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.DrawingContext.html#FillRectangle-2","s":"Fills rect (in the current control\u0027s coordinates) with color; translucent colors are blended."},{"n":"DrawingContext.DrawBitmap","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.DrawingContext.html#DrawBitmap-1","s":"Draws source of bitmap (the whole bitmap if null) at its natural size, with its top-left corner at (x, y)."},{"n":"DrawingContext.DrawBitmap","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.DrawingContext.html#DrawBitmap-2","s":"Draws source of bitmap (the whole bitmap if null) scaled to fill destination, using nearest-neighbor sampling."},{"n":"DrawingContext.DrawLine","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.DrawingContext.html#DrawLine","s":"Draws an antialiased line from (x1, y1) to (x2, y2) with round ends. Coordinates are in pixels, where (0.5, 0.5) is the center of the top-left pixel."},{"n":"DrawingContext.DrawEllipse","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.DrawingContext.html#DrawEllipse-1","s":"Draws the antialiased outline of an ellipse, centered on the curve with the given radii."},{"n":"DrawingContext.DrawEllipse","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.DrawingContext.html#DrawEllipse-2","s":"Draws the outline of the ellipse that fits bounds; the line stays inside the bounds."},{"n":"DrawingContext.FillEllipse","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.DrawingContext.html#FillEllipse-1","s":"Fills an antialiased ellipse."},{"n":"DrawingContext.FillEllipse","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.DrawingContext.html#FillEllipse-2","s":"Fills the ellipse that fits bounds."},{"n":"DrawingContext.DrawRectangle","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.DrawingContext.html#DrawRectangle","s":"Draws the outline of rect, inside its bounds."},{"n":"DrawingContext.DrawText","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.DrawingContext.html#DrawText","s":"Draws text with its top-left corner at (x, y). Lines are split by \u0027\\n\u0027; see Font.MeasureText for the size of the result."},{"n":"DrawingContext.PushClip","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.DrawingContext.html#PushClip","s":"Restricts drawing to rect (in local coordinates) until the returned scope is disposed: using (dc.PushClip(rect)) { ... }"},{"n":"DrawingContext.Clear","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.DrawingContext.html#Clear","s":"Sets every pixel inside the current clip to color, without blending. On a bitmap, Clear(Color.Transparent) erases to transparent."},{"n":"DrawingContext.ClipScope","k":"struct","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.DrawingContext.ClipScope.html","s":"Returned by DrawingContext.PushClip: disposing it restores the previous clip."},{"n":"DrawingContext.ClipScope.Dispose","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.DrawingContext.ClipScope.html#Dispose","s":"Restores the clip that was active before DrawingContext.PushClip."},{"n":"Font","k":"record","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Font.html","s":"Immutable font description. Font.Size is the em size in pixels. Use font with { Size = 20 } to derive a changed copy."},{"n":"Font.GetInstalledFamilies","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Font.html#GetInstalledFamilies","s":"Names of the font families installed on the system, sorted alphabetically; any of them can be passed to the constructor. Asks the operating system each time, so keep the result if needed often."},{"n":"Font.MeasureText","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Font.html#MeasureText","s":"Size of the box that DrawingContext.DrawText fills. Lines are split by \u0027\\n\u0027."},{"n":"Font.ToString","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Font.html#ToString","s":"Family, size and style, e.g. \u0022Noto Sans 14px Bold\u0022."},{"n":"Font.Font","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Font.html#ctor","s":"Creates a font description; the font itself is loaded when it is first used."},{"n":"Font.Default","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Font.html#Default","s":"System UI font at 14 pixels."},{"n":"Font.Family","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Font.html#Family","s":"Family name, e.g. \u0022Noto Sans\u0022, or a generic one such as \u0022sans-serif\u0022."},{"n":"Font.Size","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Font.html#Size","s":"Em size in pixels."},{"n":"Font.Style","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Font.html#Style","s":"Bold and / or italic."},{"n":"Font.Ascent","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Font.html#Ascent","s":"Pixels from the top of a line to the baseline."},{"n":"Font.Descent","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Font.html#Descent","s":"Pixels from the baseline to the bottom of a line (positive)."},{"n":"Font.LineHeight","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Font.html#LineHeight","s":"Distance between baselines of consecutive lines."},{"n":"FontStyle.Regular","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.FontStyle.html#Regular","s":"Neither bold nor italic."},{"n":"FontStyle.Bold","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.FontStyle.html#Bold","s":"Bold."},{"n":"FontStyle.Italic","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.FontStyle.html#Italic","s":"Italic."},{"n":"FontStyle","k":"enum","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.FontStyle.html","s":"Font style flags; they can be combined: FontStyle.Bold | FontStyle.Italic."},{"n":"Key.None","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#None","s":"No key (a key Doqua does not map)."},{"n":"Key.Backspace","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#Backspace","s":""},{"n":"Key.Tab","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#Tab","s":""},{"n":"Key.Enter","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#Enter","s":""},{"n":"Key.Escape","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#Escape","s":""},{"n":"Key.Space","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#Space","s":""},{"n":"Key.PageUp","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#PageUp","s":""},{"n":"Key.PageDown","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#PageDown","s":""},{"n":"Key.End","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#End","s":""},{"n":"Key.Home","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#Home","s":""},{"n":"Key.Left","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#Left","s":""},{"n":"Key.Up","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#Up","s":""},{"n":"Key.Right","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#Right","s":""},{"n":"Key.Down","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#Down","s":""},{"n":"Key.Insert","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#Insert","s":""},{"n":"Key.Delete","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#Delete","s":""},{"n":"Key.D0","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#D0","s":""},{"n":"Key.D1","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#D1","s":""},{"n":"Key.D2","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#D2","s":""},{"n":"Key.D3","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#D3","s":""},{"n":"Key.D4","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#D4","s":""},{"n":"Key.D5","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#D5","s":""},{"n":"Key.D6","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#D6","s":""},{"n":"Key.D7","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#D7","s":""},{"n":"Key.D8","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#D8","s":""},{"n":"Key.D9","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#D9","s":""},{"n":"Key.A","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#A","s":""},{"n":"Key.B","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#B","s":""},{"n":"Key.C","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#C","s":""},{"n":"Key.D","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#D","s":""},{"n":"Key.E","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#E","s":""},{"n":"Key.F","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#F","s":""},{"n":"Key.G","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#G","s":""},{"n":"Key.H","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#H","s":""},{"n":"Key.I","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#I","s":""},{"n":"Key.J","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#J","s":""},{"n":"Key.K","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#K","s":""},{"n":"Key.L","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#L","s":""},{"n":"Key.M","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#M","s":""},{"n":"Key.N","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#N","s":""},{"n":"Key.O","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#O","s":""},{"n":"Key.P","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#P","s":""},{"n":"Key.Q","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#Q","s":""},{"n":"Key.R","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#R","s":""},{"n":"Key.S","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#S","s":""},{"n":"Key.T","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#T","s":""},{"n":"Key.U","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#U","s":""},{"n":"Key.V","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#V","s":""},{"n":"Key.W","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#W","s":""},{"n":"Key.X","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#X","s":""},{"n":"Key.Y","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#Y","s":""},{"n":"Key.Z","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#Z","s":""},{"n":"Key.F1","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#F1","s":""},{"n":"Key.F2","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#F2","s":""},{"n":"Key.F3","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#F3","s":""},{"n":"Key.F4","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#F4","s":""},{"n":"Key.F5","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#F5","s":""},{"n":"Key.F6","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#F6","s":""},{"n":"Key.F7","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#F7","s":""},{"n":"Key.F8","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#F8","s":""},{"n":"Key.F9","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#F9","s":""},{"n":"Key.F10","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#F10","s":""},{"n":"Key.F11","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#F11","s":""},{"n":"Key.F12","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html#F12","s":""},{"n":"Key","k":"enum","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Key.html","s":"Physical key, independent of the keyboard layout (letters are those of the first layout)."},{"n":"KeyEventArgs","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.KeyEventArgs.html","s":"A key press: the key, the modifiers held and KeyEventArgs.Handled."},{"n":"KeyEventArgs.KeyEventArgs","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.KeyEventArgs.html#ctor","s":"Creates the event arguments."},{"n":"KeyEventArgs.Key","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.KeyEventArgs.html#Key","s":"The key that was pressed."},{"n":"KeyEventArgs.Modifiers","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.KeyEventArgs.html#Modifiers","s":"Shift, Ctrl and Alt held with the key."},{"n":"KeyEventArgs.Handled","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.KeyEventArgs.html#Handled","s":"Set to true to stop the event from reaching the parent controls and the window."},{"n":"KeyModifiers.None","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.KeyModifiers.html#None","s":"No modifier."},{"n":"KeyModifiers.Shift","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.KeyModifiers.html#Shift","s":"A Shift key."},{"n":"KeyModifiers.Control","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.KeyModifiers.html#Control","s":"A Ctrl key."},{"n":"KeyModifiers.Alt","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.KeyModifiers.html#Alt","s":"An Alt key."},{"n":"KeyModifiers","k":"enum","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.KeyModifiers.html","s":"Modifier keys held during an event; they can be combined."},{"n":"Localization","k":"static class","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Localization.html","s":"Texts shown by Doqua and by the application, in the current Localization.Culture (English by default). Localization.Get returns a text for a key: the translation for the culture (\u0022ru-RU\u0022), else for its language (\u0022ru\u0022), else Doqua\u0027s English default (Localization.DefaultTexts), else the key itself. So an application may use the English text itself as the key: Localization.Get(\u0022Hello\u0022).Translations come from code (Localization.Add) or from JSON files with one flat object of key / text pairs (Localization.LoadJson).Localization.Culture also gives month and weekday names and date formats (e.g. in DateInput). Changing it redraws all windows and raises Localization.CultureChanged, where the application updates the texts it has set on its controls. Doqua\u0027s own keys start with \u0022Doqua.\u0022; exception messages are translated too. Use it from the UI thread."},{"n":"Localization.Get","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Localization.html#Get","s":"The text for key in the current culture (see the class description for the fallbacks)."},{"n":"Localization.Format","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Localization.html#Format","s":"Localization.Get with {0}, {1}... replaced by args, formatted for the current culture."},{"n":"Localization.Add","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Localization.html#Add-1","s":"Adds or replaces one translation, e.g. Add(\u0022ru\u0022, \u0022Doqua.Menu.Copy\u0022, \u0022\u041A\u043E\u043F\u0438\u0440\u043E\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044C\u0022)."},{"n":"Localization.Add","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Localization.html#Add-2","s":"Adds or replaces several translations for culture."},{"n":"Localization.LoadJson","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Localization.html#LoadJson-1","s":"Loads translations for culture (\u0022ru\u0022 or \u0022ru-RU\u0022) from a JSON file holding one object: { \u0022Doqua.Menu.Copy\u0022: \u0022\u041A\u043E\u043F\u0438\u0440\u043E\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044C\u0022, \u0022Hello\u0022: \u0022\u041F\u0440\u0438\u0432\u0435\u0442\u0022 }."},{"n":"Localization.LoadJson","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Localization.html#LoadJson-2","s":"Loads translations for culture (\u0022ru\u0022 or \u0022ru-RU\u0022) from a JSON file holding one object: { \u0022Doqua.Menu.Copy\u0022: \u0022\u041A\u043E\u043F\u0438\u0440\u043E\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044C\u0022, \u0022Hello\u0022: \u0022\u041F\u0440\u0438\u0432\u0435\u0442\u0022 }."},{"n":"Localization.Culture","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Localization.html#Culture","s":"Language of the texts and culture for dates and numbers shown by Doqua; English (en-US) by default, or the invariant culture (also English) when the application runs in globalization-invariant mode, which has no other cultures."},{"n":"Localization.DefaultTexts","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Localization.html#DefaultTexts","s":"Doqua\u0027s own keys with their English texts: a starting point for a translation file."},{"n":"Localization.CultureChanged","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Localization.html#CultureChanged","s":"Raised after Localization.Culture changes (all windows are already scheduled for redrawing)."},{"n":"MouseButton.Left","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.MouseButton.html#Left","s":"The left (primary) button."},{"n":"MouseButton.Middle","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.MouseButton.html#Middle","s":"The middle button (often the wheel)."},{"n":"MouseButton.Right","k":"value","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.MouseButton.html#Right","s":"The right (secondary) button."},{"n":"MouseButton","k":"enum","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.MouseButton.html","s":"Mouse buttons."},{"n":"MouseEventArgs","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.MouseEventArgs.html","s":"A mouse button event: the button, the position, the modifiers and the click count."},{"n":"MouseEventArgs.MouseEventArgs","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.MouseEventArgs.html#ctor","s":"Creates the event arguments."},{"n":"MouseEventArgs.Button","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.MouseEventArgs.html#Button","s":"The button pressed or released."},{"n":"MouseEventArgs.X","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.MouseEventArgs.html#X","s":"X coordinate relative to the client area."},{"n":"MouseEventArgs.Y","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.MouseEventArgs.html#Y","s":"Y coordinate relative to the client area."},{"n":"MouseEventArgs.Modifiers","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.MouseEventArgs.html#Modifiers","s":"Keyboard modifiers held during the event (e.g. Shift\u002Bclick)."},{"n":"MouseEventArgs.ClickCount","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.MouseEventArgs.html#ClickCount","s":"1 for a single click, 2 for a double click, 3 for a triple click and so on: presses of the same button on the same control within the system double-click time and distance."},{"n":"MouseMoveEventArgs","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.MouseMoveEventArgs.html","s":"The pointer moved."},{"n":"MouseMoveEventArgs.MouseMoveEventArgs","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.MouseMoveEventArgs.html#ctor","s":"Creates the event arguments."},{"n":"MouseMoveEventArgs.X","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.MouseMoveEventArgs.html#X","s":"X coordinate relative to the control receiving the event."},{"n":"MouseMoveEventArgs.Y","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.MouseMoveEventArgs.html#Y","s":"Y coordinate relative to the control receiving the event."},{"n":"MouseMoveEventArgs.Modifiers","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.MouseMoveEventArgs.html#Modifiers","s":"Keyboard modifiers held while the pointer moved."},{"n":"MouseWheelEventArgs","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.MouseWheelEventArgs.html","s":"Mouse wheel rotation; routed from the control under the pointer up through its parents."},{"n":"MouseWheelEventArgs.MouseWheelEventArgs","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.MouseWheelEventArgs.html#ctor","s":"Creates the event arguments."},{"n":"MouseWheelEventArgs.Delta","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.MouseWheelEventArgs.html#Delta","s":"Wheel notches: positive when the wheel is rolled away from the user (scroll up)."},{"n":"MouseWheelEventArgs.X","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.MouseWheelEventArgs.html#X","s":"X coordinate relative to the control receiving the event."},{"n":"MouseWheelEventArgs.Y","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.MouseWheelEventArgs.html#Y","s":"Y coordinate relative to the control receiving the event."},{"n":"MouseWheelEventArgs.Modifiers","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.MouseWheelEventArgs.html#Modifiers","s":"Keyboard modifiers held while the wheel turned (Shift scrolls horizontally in scrolling controls)."},{"n":"MouseWheelEventArgs.Handled","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.MouseWheelEventArgs.html#Handled","s":"Set to true to stop the event from reaching the parent controls."},{"n":"Rect","k":"record struct","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Rect.html","s":"Rectangle with integer position and size, e.g. the bounds of a control."},{"n":"Rect.FromEdges","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Rect.html#FromEdges","s":"Creates a rect from its left, top, right and bottom edges (right and bottom exclusive)."},{"n":"Rect.Contains","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Rect.html#Contains","s":"True when (x, y) is inside the rectangle."},{"n":"Rect.Offset","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Rect.html#Offset","s":"The rectangle moved by (dx, dy)."},{"n":"Rect.Intersect","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Rect.html#Intersect","s":"Returns the overlapping area, or an empty rect if there is none."},{"n":"Rect.Rect","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Rect.html#ctor","s":"Rectangle with integer position and size, e.g. the bounds of a control."},{"n":"Rect.X","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Rect.html#X","s":"Left edge."},{"n":"Rect.Y","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Rect.html#Y","s":"Top edge."},{"n":"Rect.Width","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Rect.html#Width","s":"Width in pixels."},{"n":"Rect.Height","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Rect.html#Height","s":"Height in pixels."},{"n":"Rect.Right","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Rect.html#Right","s":"X \u002B Width: the first column right of the rectangle."},{"n":"Rect.Bottom","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Rect.html#Bottom","s":"Y \u002B Height: the first row below the rectangle."},{"n":"Rect.IsEmpty","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Rect.html#IsEmpty","s":"True when the width or the height is zero or negative."},{"n":"Size","k":"record struct","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Size.html","s":"Width and height in pixels."},{"n":"Size.Size","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Size.html#ctor","s":"Width and height in pixels."},{"n":"Size.Width","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Size.html#Width","s":"Width in pixels."},{"n":"Size.Height","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Size.html#Height","s":"Height in pixels."},{"n":"TextInputEventArgs","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.TextInputEventArgs.html","s":"Text typed by the user, as produced by the keyboard layout and input method."},{"n":"TextInputEventArgs.TextInputEventArgs","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.TextInputEventArgs.html#ctor","s":"Creates the event arguments."},{"n":"TextInputEventArgs.Text","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.TextInputEventArgs.html#Text","s":"The typed text."},{"n":"TextInputEventArgs.Handled","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.TextInputEventArgs.html#Handled","s":"Set to true to stop the event from reaching the parent controls."},{"n":"Timer","k":"static class","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Timer.html","s":"JavaScript-style timers. Callbacks run on the GUI thread from the event loop, never while another callback or event handler is running. Call these methods from the GUI thread; from another thread, Application.Post the call."},{"n":"Timer.SetTimeout","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Timer.html#SetTimeout","s":"Runs callback once after milliseconds. Returns the timer id."},{"n":"Timer.SetInterval","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Timer.html#SetInterval","s":"Runs callback every milliseconds until cleared. Returns the timer id."},{"n":"Timer.ClearTimeout","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Timer.html#ClearTimeout","s":"Cancels a timer. Unknown or already finished ids are ignored."},{"n":"Timer.ClearInterval","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Timer.html#ClearInterval","s":"Cancels a timer. Unknown or already finished ids are ignored."},{"n":"Window","k":"class","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html","s":"Top-level window decorated by the OS window manager. Hosts a single Window.Content control (usually a Panel) that always fills the client area."},{"n":"Window.Show","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html#Show","s":"Shows the window (Application.Run shows the main window itself)."},{"n":"Window.ShowModal","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html#ShowModal","s":"Shows this window as a modal dialog of owner, instead of Window.Show. It returns at once; until this window closes, the owner gets no mouse or keyboard input (a click on it brings the dialog to the front). The dialog is kept above the owner, has no taskbar entry of its own, is centred over the owner and takes the keyboard focus; it closes with the owner. Handle Window.Closed for the result. If the owner already has a modal dialog, this one becomes a dialog of that dialog."},{"n":"Window.Activate","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html#Activate","s":"Brings the window to the front and gives it the keyboard focus, if the window manager allows it."},{"n":"Window.Close","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html#Close","s":"Closes the window; closing the main window ends Application.Run."},{"n":"Window.Invalidate","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html#Invalidate","s":"Schedules a redraw. Multiple requests are merged into one. Controls call it whenever they change, so it also detects controls changed from a thread other than the GUI thread (use Application.Post)."},{"n":"Window.OnClosed","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html#OnClosed","s":""},{"n":"Window.OnMouseClick","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html#OnMouseClick","s":""},{"n":"Window.OnKeyDown","k":"method","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html#OnKeyDown","s":""},{"n":"Window.Window","k":"constructor","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html#ctor","s":"Creates an 800 x 600 window; it appears with Window.Show or Application.Run."},{"n":"Window.Title","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html#Title","s":"Text of the title bar."},{"n":"Window.Icons","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html#Icons","s":"Window icon for the title bar and taskbar, as one bitmap per size (for example 16, 32 and 256 pixels). The system picks the size it needs and scales the closest one. Empty means no icon."},{"n":"Window.Width","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html#Width","s":"Client area width in pixels."},{"n":"Window.Height","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html#Height","s":"Client area height in pixels."},{"n":"Window.Background","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html#Background","s":"Color of the client area not covered by Window.Content."},{"n":"Window.Content","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html#Content","s":"Root control of the window. It is resized to fill the client area."},{"n":"Window.FocusedControl","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html#FocusedControl","s":"Control that receives keyboard input, or null. Setting it is the same as Control.Focus, but throws if the control cannot be focused."},{"n":"Window.Resizable","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html#Resizable","s":"Whether the user can resize the window with its frame (and maximize it). True by default; dialogs usually set it to false. Window.Width and Window.Height can still be changed from code."},{"n":"Window.Owner","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html#Owner","s":"The window this one was shown for with Window.ShowModal, or null."},{"n":"Window.HasModalDialog","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html#HasModalDialog","s":"True while a window shown with Window.ShowModal for this one is open: this window then gets no input."},{"n":"Window.IsActive","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html#IsActive","s":"True while the window has the keyboard focus of the operating system."},{"n":"Window.IsClosed","k":"property","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html#IsClosed","s":"True after the window has been closed."},{"n":"Window.Closed","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html#Closed","s":"Raised after the window has closed."},{"n":"Window.KeyDown","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html#KeyDown","s":"Raised for keys not handled by the focused control or its parents. Tab navigation runs after it."},{"n":"Window.MouseClick","k":"event","u":"api/Doqua.GUI.Window.html#MouseClick","s":"Raised when a mouse button is pressed and released inside the client area, after the Control.MouseClick of the control under the pointer."}];
